Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate scary movies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should be studying You know I got a bio due
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Baby，did I mention these tickets are free？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Free
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sandra Bullock is playing right down the street
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody will pay seven fifty to see some Sandra Bullock shit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless she is naked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you will sit through a movie called 「Stab」？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Adrenaline，Maureen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is good to be scared。It is primal。You know what I'm saying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm gonna tell you what it is。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a dumb ass white movie about some dumb ass white girls…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,getting their white asses cut the fuck up，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，and I suppose Sandra Bullock is miss ethnicity？Right？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm saying that the horror genre is historical for excluding…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,the African-American element
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did you get your PHD in black cinema，sister soldier？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.77,0:01:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I read my 「Entertainment Weekly」，I know my shit
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.23,0:01:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Maureen，I read my 「Black Beat」 too，homey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you going to have a all-black movie？Black-cast？All-black wardrobe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Black-eyes peas？Black cats？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，here you go…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this？
