Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it's white，thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very romantic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，why does she got to be naked？What does that have to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the plot of the story her being butt-ass naked
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I don't know about the plot but I have got a stiffy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better loosen up that wrist
