Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，really，who is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Were you expecting somebody？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bitch，hang the phone up and 「star-69」 his ass！
