Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got money
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got 「my」 money I asked for your money
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you say？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Cat got your tongue？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I don't even know you and I dislike you already
