Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it I am not going back in there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，you chicken shit it's just a movie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not it's not just a movie It's a true story
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,All these kids got killed a couple of years ago in California
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ass！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，I had to，baby
