Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stop playing so much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright I have to go to the bathroom
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you inside
