Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no！Don't do that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move，move… Go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Baby，give it up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You came back just in time，it looks like she's just about to get it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Want some popcorn？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that was me，I'dbe out of there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here it comes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Sidney
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who this is？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your favorite scary movie？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.32,0:12:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cory Gillis，5550176
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,hot flash，Cory
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call criminal offense prosecutor on the penal code 653M
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hope you enjoy the movie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to change numbers again
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it will die off。It's opening weekend。Let's see how it goes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，Ron
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not an easy thing to be accused of a crime you didn't commit
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Particularly one as heinous as murder
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,But how do people treat you now that they know the truth…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,about your innocence
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most people are good
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are still some that keep a safe distance
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,which is odd for me 'cause I've always been sort of a people person
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were wrongly accused You were fully exonerated
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,That and a nickel gets you a cup of coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even that's not true anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Certainly with Gale Weather's book and now the movie…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.13,0:13:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,it sets the record straight for Cotton Weary
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,One would think Gale has been terrific through all this…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Move your ass，you're late
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't forget about the routine mixer and the Delta Lambda Zeta
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll be able to make it，Hal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What！Don't even try to bag you promised me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,A vague promise at best
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody's asking you to join。It's a party。Free beer，meet the girls
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hallie，you know me and organized religion
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.99,0:13:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a sorority…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Worse
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look Sid，lower the walIs for the next few days
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,This self-induced isolation you got going is not healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.66,0:14:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine。Yeah，I know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine is stretched tightly across your face
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check out the news
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,The two Windsor college students were murdered last night…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,during a sneak preview of the new movie，「Stab」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Police have not released any infor- mation except for the victims names
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,But a press conference has been scheduled later today
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,The victims，Maureen Evens & Phil Stevens were both Windsor seniors
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Randy？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got film theory this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you know the victims？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you feel threatened by the murders？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll be more murders？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What can you tell us about the victims，Sid？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just need one statement
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You could say what happened in that theater…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.35,0:15:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,is a direct result of the movie itself
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is so moral majority
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't blame real life violence on entertainment
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，you can Don't you even watch the news？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？The murderer was wearing a Ghost mask
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like in the movie It's directly responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's not。Movies are not responsible for our actions
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a classic case of life imitating art，imitating life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not a hypothetical It's not about that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had biology with that girl This is reality
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，I agree with you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me tell you about reality Mickey
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I lived through this，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Life is life It doesn't imitate anything
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Randy。With all due respect the killer obviously pattered…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,himself，after two serial killers who have been immortalized on film
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting that someone is trying to make a real life sequel？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stab 2？Who would wanna do that Sequel's suck
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，please，please。By definition alone，they're inferior films
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bullshit generalization。Many sequeIs have surpassed their originals
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh yeah？Name one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Aliens」 Far better than the first
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah there's no accounting for taste
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Ridley Scott rules Name another
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aliens is a classic，okay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Get away from her，you Bitch」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I believe the line is 「Stay away from her，you Bitch」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is film class right？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever，you know what I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another…T-2
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.26,0:16:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a hard on for Cameron
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,A big one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.01,0:16:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a second the first Terminator is historical
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Sarah Conner」 「Yes」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，alright 「House 2」 the second story
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,The entire horror genre was destroyed by sequels
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got it by the way，I got it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Godfather Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's very good An Oscar Winning Exception
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，that's enough That will be a wrap
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:17:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sequel discussion to be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，Mister Originality how would you make it different
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would let the geek get the girl
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three hundred people watching and nobody did anything
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,They thought it was a publicity stunt。For Christ's sake
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it would have been a good one too
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's starting again，Randy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not Shit happens at the movies
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.24,0:17:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,People get robbed，shot maimed，murdered
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The multiplex is just very dangerous place be these days
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in extreme denial
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you should be too This has nothing to do with us
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Randy。A guy in a Ghost mask hacked up two people in a movie theater
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,in a movie theater telling our life stories
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coincidence
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what happened in Woodsboro Randy。You can't ignore it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know Sid。I don't wanna go back there again
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't we just go back to our pseudo-quasi happy existence？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.89,0:17:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello Derek，how you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，I've been looking everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard，you weren't in class
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I know。I couldn't take all the 「that's her」 looks
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have any tricks to take us back to a pseudo-quasi happy existence？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know I just might have one for that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh yeah，what is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was pretty good
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get a room
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're threatening what？Are you kidding me？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.81,0:18:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would be stupid to pull this movie
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,All this free press，they're going to have huge numbers this weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll break box office records
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Consider it done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Weathers！Hi。I'm Joel the affiliate sent me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the new cameraman
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got experience？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm local but I shot the Bingo Finals。Almost got an award for that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright。Listen Joel this is how it works
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I point，you shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stay focused and fast on your feet。And we'll get along fine
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're playing with the big boys now。You got it？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it。Got you covered。I'm all over it。Don't worry…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,about a thing。How hard can it be？You point & I shoot。I'm there
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，Miss Weathers？Could I have a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No… Just one second？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you probably get this all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.35,0:19:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I just wanted to say that I'm such a big fan of your work
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just finished your book。I couldn't put it down。lnsightful，probing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just really really loved your book
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a writer myself。I write for the local paper for The Post Telegraph
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Debbie Salt
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I took your seminar in Chicago last year
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was the one in the front row asking all the questions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you looked familiar
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you Can't wait to see the movie
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，you must be getting quite a lot of flak on that。Right？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,W/ all the violence & cinema issues What is your position going to be？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No comment
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would be such an honor for me If I could just get a quote…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,from you for my story
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.85,0:19:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，begin quote
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.85,0:20:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your flattering remarks are both desperate and obvious。End quote
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？Do you think these murders are connected？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your theory on these murders？What's your feeling on this？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I have your attention
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name if Chief Louis Hartley
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chief Hartley
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Gale Weathers author of the Woodsboro Murders
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think the killer will strike again？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have no evidence that this is a serial killer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'dlike to read from a…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you tell us of any precautions that you are taking？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,First of all，we think it's just an isolated incident
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we will be caring out many possibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh my God，this is huge
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have any suspects？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，look，it's Gale Weathers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Starring in the Gale Weathers Press Conference
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,based on the book by Gale Weathers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Soon to be a major motion picture starring Gale Weathers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be kind，she saved our lives
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,She had calf-implants
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.07,0:20:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chief Hartley，do you have plan on giving the town a curfew？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.07,0:20:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get closer
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,So that's her？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello girls，enjoying yourselves？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Sister Lois Sister Murphy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Sidney
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,This must be flat out hell for you How are you holding up？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I manage
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's weird，isn't it？To think this fuss is all because of you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean not directly。But in some six degrees of Kevin Bacon way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you going to bring your friend to our little martini mixer tonight？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a lot of work to…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.45,0:21:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good，Because Sid we have our eyes on you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hang in there，and if there is anything we can do…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Delta lambaste are very sensitive to your plight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah…Bye
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You going to start to dress like that when you get in？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not going to happen
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Delta Lambdas are the biggest bunch of fucking…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.47,0:22:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm pledging Delta Lambda thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh my God
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.77,0:22:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.66,0:22:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was worried about you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.12,0:22:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard about what happened I was on the next plane
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we talk？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.33,0:22:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine，Dewey
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.21,0:22:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or was… Things were okay Until now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.17,0:22:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,The theater's going great。I got my first starring role，open in two days
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is great
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.81,0:22:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm loving it And I've got some great friends
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm seeing someone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.94,0:22:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice guy，pre-med no apparent psychotic tendencies
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was just worried
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.91,0:23:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look Sid，if there is some freaked out psycho trying to follow in…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy Loomis' footsteps
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.16,0:23:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You probably already know him Or her
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,or them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're probably already in your life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,They get off on that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want you to be careful，Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think I don't know that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What am I suppose to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cut everybody off crawl under a rock？What？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.11,0:23:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just watch out Keep an eye out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.49,0:23:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to talk to Chief Hartley and the local police
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.50,0:23:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to just hang around I want to make sure you're safe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.96,0:23:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that's alright with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.21,0:24:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who was that guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,An old friend
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deputy Dewey。Woodsboro's finest What's he doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.74,0:24:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's worried Our surrogate big brother
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing like a funeral to bring the family together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.16,0:24:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to go say Hi
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.12,0:24:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chief Hartley said the girl was stabbed seven…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.87,0:24:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.71,0:24:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Sidney，how are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.09,0:24:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，what do you want，Gale？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.21,0:24:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was hoping I might get a few words with you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.47,0:24:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Sidney
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.93,0:24:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we are at Windsor College where Sidney Prescott has just…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.48,0:24:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,be united with Cotton Weary for the first time since she wrongly…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.90,0:25:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,accused him of murdering her mother
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.23,0:25:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,We want to know how you feel？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell us everything that has happened Looking back on the last two years
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，I'djust like to say that I forgive and forget
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.66,0:25:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like you，I'dlike to get back on with my own life
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.99,0:25:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have any comments？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.16,0:25:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You bitch
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.66,0:25:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，share with us please
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.75,0:25:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll share with you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.38,0:25:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay，okay
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.42,0:25:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you get that on film？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.05,0:25:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I got that on film
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.22,0:25:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid？Wait，wait where's she going，Gale？Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's she going？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.35,0:25:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，I thought we had an official interview。What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.02,0:25:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,She didn't know？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.31,0:25:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was cold…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.89,0:25:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to check your conscious at the door，sweetie
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.73,0:25:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not here to be loved
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.19,0:25:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，you promised me ten minutes of national coverage
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.82,0:25:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll get your ten minutes when I get my God damned interview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.07,0:25:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't walk away from me，Gale I'm still…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.99,0:25:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，I did my part
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.24,0:25:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joel
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.38,0:26:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey。What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you just leave her alone
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.92,0:26:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hasn't she been through enough？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.14,0:26:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,And my name is Dwight
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.76,0:26:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just doing my job，Dwight
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.73,0:26:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter who gets hurt in the process
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.06,0:26:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who got punched here，again
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.40,0:26:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't condone violence but maybe you deserved it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.19,0:26:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Page thirty-two
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.90,0:26:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deputy Dewey filled the room with his Barney Fifish presence
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.33,0:26:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You read my book
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.70,0:26:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I do read，Miss Weathers
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.79,0:26:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，don't take it so seriously It's just a character in a book
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.08,0:26:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Page forty-one Deputy Dewey oozed with inexperience
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.26,0:26:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're overacting just a little bit？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.05,0:26:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，what I think is you're a money-hungry，fame-seeking…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.10,0:27:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,and forgive me for saying mediocre writer
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.23,0:27:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,who has a cold storage shed where her heart should be
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.23,0:27:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,No offense intended
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.65,0:27:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，I never meant to imply…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know my dimwitted inexperience isn't merely a subtle…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.61,0:27:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,form of manipulation used to lower people's expectations thereby…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.78,0:27:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,enhancing my ability to effectively maneuver within any given situation？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.17,0:27:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.13,0:27:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what else to say Except，I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.18,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I'm the one that's sorry I misjudged you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.98,0:27:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，if you'll excuse me I have some oozing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.23,0:27:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,One more thing。Nice streaks
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.67,0:28:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not a sorority pusher
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.38,0:28:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just think despite its trivialities
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.42,0:28:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's a life affirming，mentally stable healthy environment for you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.43,0:28:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at this place
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.97,0:28:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you're talking your psych-major a little too seriously，Hallie
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.77,0:28:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.77,0:28:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's beginning to become your theme song。I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，fucked up，lnsecure Neurotic and Emotional
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.78,0:28:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，you made it
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.45,0:28:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。No I really mean that，Hi
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.41,0:28:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you girIs want a drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.70,0:28:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，we'll get it ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.59,0:29:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love those guys，are they still together？I haven't seen it in 3 weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.39,0:29:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，they broke up again Sarah，found out that
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.77,0:29:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bailey slept with Gwen She dumped him like two episodes ago
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.23,0:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish she'd get her shit together
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.90,0:29:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on，someone's calling
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.86,0:29:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Omega Beta Zeta
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.23,0:29:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.07,0:29:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.07,0:29:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.91,0:29:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cici。Who's this？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.78,0:29:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.08,0:29:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ted？Where are you are you drinking？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.87,0:29:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.08,0:29:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ted's on the other line He sounds drunk，I'll call you back？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.25,0:29:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,That shit only calIs you when he's drunk。Don't go over there，Cici
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.71,0:29:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，alright I'll call you back
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.76,0:29:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay Ted，you sound loaded What's up？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.22,0:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's Ted？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.39,0:29:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。My bad ears I thought you were someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.14,0:29:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's okay。I am
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you calling for nobody's here
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.44,0:29:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is everybody？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.27,0:30:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're co-sponsoring the Acid Rain Mixer at the Phi Gamma Alpha tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.90,0:30:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why aren't you there？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.15,0:30:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sober sister I have to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,in case a drunk sister calIs and needs a ride
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.16,0:30:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's too bad
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.70,0:30:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drink with your brain That's our motto
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.16,0:30:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you calling for？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.25,0:30:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if I said，you？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.67,0:30:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if I said goodbye？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.04,0:30:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would you wanna do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.01,0:30:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you always answer a question with a question？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.76,0:30:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm inquisitive
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.47,0:30:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，and I'm impatient Do you want to leave a message…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.97,0:30:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you want to die tonight，Cici？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Omega Beta Zeta
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.03,0:30:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So was it Teddy？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.32,0:30:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it was some creep asshole trying to scare me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.78,0:30:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the movie STAB It's bringing out the crazies
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.16,0:30:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.12,0:30:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.08,0:30:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard a noise
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.29,0:30:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.08,0:30:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Upstairs
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.09,0:30:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.46,0:31:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.01,0:31:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill，kill，kill。Die，die，die
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.22,0:31:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.26,0:31:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're alone in that house
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.72,0:31:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.35,0:31:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.86,0:31:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're breaking up。Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.86,0:31:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Outside
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.91,0:31:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't panic，sweetie Call Campus Security
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.12,0:31:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.29,0:31:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Campus Security
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.38,0:31:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，I'm calling from
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.04,0:31:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't hear… Hello？Hello？Can you hear me now？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Shit
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.72,0:31:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Campus Security
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.39,0:31:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I'm calling from…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.77,0:31:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't hear you。Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.73,0:32:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm calling from the Omega Beta Zeta house。Someone's harassing me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.98,0:32:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.45,0:32:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus，Dawnie，you scared me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.45,0:32:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。Did anyone call for me？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.08,0:32:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.74,0:32:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I live here，remember？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.75,0:32:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just thought you were going to the mixer
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.33,0:32:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I had to change So I'll be out of here now
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.05,0:32:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Omega Beta Zeta
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.26,0:32:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cici there？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.38,0:32:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's calling？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.88,0:32:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Ted
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.09,0:32:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's your ill-conceived boyfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.31,0:32:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I'll see you later And don't forget to set the alarm
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.69,0:32:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Ted
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.03,0:32:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wish it was Ted Don't forget to set the alarm
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.33,0:34:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.24,0:35:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！Please！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.97,0:35:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks Sororitys are about blowjobs，but it's not true
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.27,0:35:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We only promote safe condom sex
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.10,0:35:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're about love respect and responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.36,0:35:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harmonica style is okay，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.19,0:35:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.32,0:35:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cocktails？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.86,0:35:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What took you so long？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.07,0:35:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you know Derek is a Delta Lambda big brother
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.70,0:35:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we like to keep it all in the family
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.12,0:35:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You girIs have really given me a lot to think about。Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's working
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.13,0:35:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey baby，wanna dance？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.79,0:35:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'dlove to
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.34,0:36:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,With that tall wide shouldered Fraternity boy
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.84,0:36:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,That hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.89,0:36:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Empire Strikes Back Better story，improved effects
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.35,0:36:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a sequel。Party of a trilogy completely planned
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.14,0:36:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like those little furry things
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.94,0:36:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ewoks…They blow
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.19,0:36:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you doing？Good
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.86,0:36:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are the Twits being nice to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.32,0:36:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Painfully nice
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I take it will not being pledging Delta Lambda Zeta
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.20,0:36:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think not
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.12,0:36:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crushed
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.91,0:36:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey guys！Something is up at Omega Beta Zeta。The Police are everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.87,0:36:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.10,0:36:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a way to break up a party
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.73,0:36:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit I should have brought my drink
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.08,0:37:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,So it's definitely not suicide
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.08,0:37:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.21,0:37:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，Hi。You're just getting here？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.75,0:37:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not good It's a single victim。Sorority girl
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.72,0:37:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got to go。I've got a deadline
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.05,0:37:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joel，let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.64,0:37:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,In a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.97,0:37:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's happening again，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.44,0:37:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You would love that，wouldn't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.15,0:37:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better hurry，Gale you might get scooped
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.16,0:37:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move it，Joel
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.41,0:37:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I have to be honest with you
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.87,0:37:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out for this。I was brought here to do an interview
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.91,0:37:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not see 「Faces of Death 14？」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.42,0:37:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not fuck with me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，get your jacket Let's get you home
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.06,0:38:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.43,0:38:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you about ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.68,0:38:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.40,0:39:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.82,0:39:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello Sidney，Remember me？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.99,0:39:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.28,0:39:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you，it's show time
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.12,0:39:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then why don't you show your face you fucking coward
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.70,0:39:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,My pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.16,0:39:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.84,0:39:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.00,0:39:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.90,0:39:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's me！It's me！Are you okay！You okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.36,0:39:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek，don't
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.87,0:39:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.45,0:39:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.29,0:39:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer's in there，and Derek
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.89,0:40:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you alright？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.81,0:40:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,He went that way
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.68,0:40:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，get in here
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.86,0:40:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is everything okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.99,0:40:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He got me。He got me
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.99,0:40:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Apply pressure to it
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.91,0:40:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Police are on their way
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.43,0:40:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for your cooperation
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.80,0:40:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hallie，I'll be with you in a few minutes，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.06,0:41:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problem
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.43,0:41:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easiest interrogation of my crime filled life
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.85,0:41:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to go get a cup of coffee You want？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.15,0:41:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want some，Sid？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.70,0:41:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you doing，are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.03,0:41:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.29,0:41:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I knew this was coming I knew this wasn't over
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.33,0:41:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are not alone，Sid
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.67,0:41:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're all here for you Alright。Whatever you need
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.68,0:41:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poor girl
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.93,0:41:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，it's crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.22,0:41:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek could have been killed you know
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.02,0:41:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he wasn't。He's fine
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.85,0:41:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,He just need to realize that the 90's are no time to play hero
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.19,0:41:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why did he go back into that house anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.32,0:42:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I went around to the back of the house，and ran into Sid there
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.33,0:42:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's when she told me the killer was inside。So I went into see…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.16,0:42:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're lucky there is no nerve damage
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.46,0:42:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're going to have to take it easy though
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.46,0:42:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,So then you went back inside the house
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.17,0:42:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.09,0:42:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,No struggling he just cut you and ran away？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.26,0:42:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're lucky he didn't kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.14,0:42:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's awfully convenient
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.85,0:42:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say what？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.35,0:42:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。It's just a shame he got away so easily
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.81,0:42:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a shame you got there too late
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.23,0:42:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right after he disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.78,0:42:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it is
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.84,0:43:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have three victims
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.39,0:43:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maureen Evens，Phil Stevens
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.97,0:43:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cici Cooper
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.06,0:43:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is Cici the girl's real name？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.98,0:43:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's Casey。Casey Cooper
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.28,0:43:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,As in Casey Becker？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.40,0:43:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.95,0:43:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was a young victim in Woodsboro
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.32,0:43:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,As well as her boyfriend Steven Orth
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.83,0:43:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,As in Phil Stevens
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.83,0:43:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maureen Evens。Maureen Prescott
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.38,0:43:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,that's Sidney's mother
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.09,0:43:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think someone's trying to duplicate Woodsboro？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.21,0:43:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks like it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.38,0:43:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you have a copycat on your hands，Chief
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.26,0:43:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.93,0:43:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing to keep Sidney safe？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.27,0:43:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got my two best detectives guarding her
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.40,0:43:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do these guys have to follow you around everywhere？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.06,0:43:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're attached at the hip
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.28,0:44:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,How I am ever going to get you alone？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.32,0:44:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,To be honest，Derek，I think it would be best to…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.08,0:44:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,your interest to stay as far away from me as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.37,0:44:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hope that was a off the cuff remark that holds no sub-text what so ever
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.34,0:44:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I mean it
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.72,0:44:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at you，you already got hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.81,0:44:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to see that happen again
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.39,0:44:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take my chances
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.02,0:44:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek，I'm serious This is serious
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.40,0:44:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are concerned with my personal well being。And not with…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.83,0:44:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,trusting me or anything。Right？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.83,0:44:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like I said，I just don't want to see you get hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.13,0:45:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I don't want to see you get hurt。Okay Sid？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.77,0:45:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take care，Miss Weathers
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.73,0:45:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.23,0:45:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chief
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.99,0:45:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，I'm headed over to admissions to do some leg work，You game？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.82,0:45:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not here to write a book I'm here to help Sid
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.21,0:45:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanna help her too
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.38,0:45:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,And help myself，of course
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.38,0:45:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Dewey Smile just once，please
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.93,0:45:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll smile when I catch the killer
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.93,0:45:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，Hi
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.89,0:46:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about Sidney's father？Has he been ruled out as a suspect？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.10,0:46:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's out of the country on business that sounds a little fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.90,0:46:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not here to do your job Mrs Salt
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.61,0:46:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about this ex-cop Dewey Riley？Kind of strange that he showed up
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.74,0:46:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's he doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.66,0:46:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey's a good guy Unlike some of us
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.62,0:46:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.33,0:46:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the killer is repeating what happened in Woodsboro
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.08,0:46:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,It could be quite possible that killer could be from Woodsboro
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.76,0:46:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek，do you think Sid would let me interview her for my documentary
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.26,0:46:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't she turn down 「Primetime Live」，「20-20」，and 「Dateline」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.77,0:46:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But for you，yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.43,0:46:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.27,0:46:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about his whole murder thing
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.69,0:46:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you checked out Randy？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.15,0:46:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,What！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.94,0:46:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know he's an innocent victim the first time around
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.15,0:46:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he's a little off You know what I'm saying？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.15,0:46:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Randy？The guy is harmless
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.11,0:46:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what they said about Damher
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.91,0:46:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，keep it down，come on
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.83,0:46:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up，Sid？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.95,0:46:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's it going？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.79,0:47:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's the Secret Service guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.16,0:47:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over there
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.21,0:47:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And which one is Kevin Costner？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.80,0:47:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one on the right is Officer Richard
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.26,0:47:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is a Capricorn Divorced，father of Two
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.30,0:47:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the one on the left is Officer Andrews
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.81,0:47:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is a Gemini Single，but I think he's Gay
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.06,0:47:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek，a penny for your thoughts？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.15,0:47:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,This morning I woke up with this feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.74,0:47:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't know how to deal with
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.20,0:47:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And so I just decided to myseIf I'dhide it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.66,0:47:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is he doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.00,0:47:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tom Cruise，Top Gun 1986
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.29,0:47:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek，don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.30,0:47:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't do this
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.17,0:47:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.05,0:47:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that what life is made of？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.68,0:48:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Though it worries me to say I've never feIt this way
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.98,0:48:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I love you！So what am I so afraid of
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.98,0:48:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that I'm not sure of A love there is no cure for
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.61,0:48:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I love you Isn't that what life is made of
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.41,0:48:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,And though it worries me to say it I've never feIt this way
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.04,0:48:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Believe me，you don't have to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.37,0:48:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only want to make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.63,0:48:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you say，hey go away！I will
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.96,0:48:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I think I'dbetter stick around and love you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.05,0:48:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until you find happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.22,0:48:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me ask you，do you think Do you really love me？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.76,0:48:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I think I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.91,0:49:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，people let's show a little love
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.75,0:49:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，Sid
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.76,0:49:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know things are a little crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.34,0:49:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that a big，Frat faux-pas？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.89,0:49:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that is a big no-no
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.43,0:49:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，you're not suppose to give your Greek letters to your girl
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.89,0:49:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No shape，way or form
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.93,0:49:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Brothers are gonna kick his ass But it's tradition
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.77,0:49:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's tradition
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.02,0:49:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good luck It will protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.29,0:49:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,So tell us about this part you're getting rave reviews for
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.46,0:49:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I play this girl，Sidney Prescott
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.71,0:49:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who discovers her boyfriend is a crazy serial killer
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.22,0:50:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,who also killed her mother the year before that
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.97,0:50:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what kind of research did you do for the part？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.80,0:50:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I read the book…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.80,0:50:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,They get Tori Spelling to play Sid
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.97,0:50:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they cast Joe-Blow Nobody to play me
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.14,0:50:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least you get David Schwimmer
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.27,0:50:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get the guy who drove Jane Seymour's stagecoach…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.36,0:50:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,in one episode of Doctor Quinn
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.32,0:50:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's take a peak at the movie…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.33,0:50:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy，you scared me what are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.12,0:50:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,They let me go Sid I didn't do it。I'm innocent
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.83,0:50:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.34,0:50:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me touch you？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.67,0:50:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I've been going through a lot lately，Billy
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.84,0:50:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，I think you just need to deal with that and move on
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.43,0:50:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,When my mom left my dad，I accepted it.That's the way the cookie crumbles
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.69,0:50:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moms leave
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.69,0:50:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，your mom left town。She's not buried in the cemetery somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.07,0:51:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mom's dead and she's never coming back。Ever
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.28,0:51:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.99,0:51:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love scary movies
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.04,0:51:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll wait for the video
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.91,0:51:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，let's get down to business
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.66,0:51:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,The way I see it someone's out to make a sequel
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.83,0:51:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，cash in on all the murder movie hoopla
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.38,0:51:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,So it's our job to observe the rules of a sequel
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.92,0:51:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Number one the body count is always bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.21,0:51:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Number two，the death scenes are always much more elaborate。More…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.34,0:51:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,blood，more gore。Carnage Candy Your core audience just expects it
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.22,0:51:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,And number three…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.31,0:51:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you want your sequel to become a franchise never，ever…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.23,0:51:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do we find the killer，Randy？That's what I want to know
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.77,0:51:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's look at the suspects
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.15,0:51:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's Derek the obvious boyfriend Hello Billy Loomis
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.40,0:51:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guy's pre-med and his pity-me service wound
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.86,0:51:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,conveniently missed every major vein and artery
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.07,0:51:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you think it's Derek？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.91,0:51:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's assume the killer or killers have haIf a brain
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not a 「Nick at Night」 re-run type of guy
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.79,0:51:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wants to break some new ground Right？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.79,0:52:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,forget the boyfriend It's tired。Who else do we got？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.05,0:52:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mickey The freaky Tarantino film student
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.26,0:52:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if he is a suspect So am l。So let's move on
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.22,0:52:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's not move on Maybe you are a suspect
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.22,0:52:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I'm a suspect，you're a suspect
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.15,0:52:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a point
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.90,0:52:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，let's move on
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.07,0:52:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hallie
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.11,0:52:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid's roommate？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.24,0:52:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Serial killers are typically white males
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.28,0:52:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why it's perfect。It's sort of against the rules，but not really
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.12,0:52:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs。Voohies was a terrific serial killer
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.91,0:52:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,And there's always room for Candy Man's daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.92,0:52:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's sweet。She's deadly She's bad for your teeth
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.80,0:52:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Randy These kids are your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.30,0:52:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you think is the killer？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.09,0:52:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about Gale Weathers？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.14,0:52:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，a killer？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.31,0:52:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.98,0:52:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's vicious enough
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.14,0:52:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's an opportunist
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.98,0:53:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't it conceivable She's planning her next book
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.81,0:53:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what reporters do Dewey。They stage the news
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.69,0:53:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Gale's a lot of things but Gale's not a killer
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.45,0:53:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just because you're sweet on her
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.20,0:53:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.95,0:53:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，this is me talking，Randy
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.20,0:53:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The unrequited love slave of Sidney Prescott
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.75,0:53:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know all about obsession
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.29,0:53:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,and pain
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.71,0:53:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you've got your love scar to prove it
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.29,0:53:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,And so do you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.00,0:53:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，what is with that limp anyway？'Cause you were stabbed in the back
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.96,0:53:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Severed nerve
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.67,0:53:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Gale's no killer
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.72,0:53:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay，whatever you say
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.80,0:53:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if she's not a killer she's a target
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.89,0:53:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joel，let's get some establishing shots
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.73,0:53:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，can we talk for a second？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.48,0:53:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.32,0:53:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I'm a little confused here I mean，with your track record
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.32,0:53:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would you want to be here when the killer strikes again？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.86,0:53:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean granted，I should have read your book。Before I took this job
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.99,0:53:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，I'm reading it now，and whoa
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.87,0:53:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I read what happened to your last cameraman
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.04,0:54:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guy got gutted
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.08,0:54:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now me？I would do what any rational human being should do
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.83,0:54:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which is get the fuck out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.34,0:54:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,First of all，he wasn't gutted I made that up
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.76,0:54:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,His throat was slashed
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.92,0:54:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，gutted-slashed the guy ain't in the union no more
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.72,0:54:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a job，Joel
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.72,0:54:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,And like every job there's a few drawbacks
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.14,0:54:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a professional cameraman You've got to act like one
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.31,0:54:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but I want to report the news I don't want to be the news
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.10,0:54:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，「Brothers」 don't last long in situations like this
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.27,0:54:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is national television
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.69,0:54:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think about it This is a big chance for you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.90,0:54:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,The story is monumental Don't you want to be a part of that？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.08,0:54:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，I need you I cannot do this without you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.21,0:54:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good，come on Let's get some work done
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.46,0:54:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，let's go get killed
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.93,0:54:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been through this before
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.09,0:54:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I think of your potential as an actress
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.72,0:55:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it's just that with the murders
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.77,0:55:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the movie，and my life
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.10,0:55:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I do know how difficuIt it is for you
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.36,0:55:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gil，I just don't think I can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.40,0:55:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The battle for the soul is fought in the forum of the art
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.12,0:55:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a fighter Sid That's why you're here
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.20,0:55:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why this is your major
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.91,0:55:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm a fighter
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.41,0:55:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't hear that
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.91,0:55:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a fighter
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.08,0:55:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe you
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.96,0:55:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.01,0:55:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a fighter
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.97,0:55:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.64,0:55:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,So at the risk sounding like a college drama teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.18,0:55:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you have pain around this type of material，use it
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.15,0:55:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your role，Sid
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.81,0:55:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cassandra is one of the great tragic visionaries of literature
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.19,0:55:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,She saw it all coming
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.95,0:56:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The wars，the murder，the madness
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.12,0:56:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,She knew she was cursed
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.33,0:56:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was her fate and she embraced it
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.92,0:56:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,None of us can avoid our fate But as an artist…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.38,0:56:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,you can honestly face it and fight it
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.14,0:56:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're good
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.68,0:56:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no understudy I'm desperate
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.64,0:56:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.78,0:56:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，everybody gather around third act，one last time
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.15,0:56:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cue the music
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.17,0:56:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behold the dreaded fate of Troy
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.88,0:57:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,That once stood proud and light upon the hilIs of Sparta
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.05,0:57:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now shrouded in the deathly smoke of ruin
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.31,0:57:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her royal children picthed from her walls
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.73,0:57:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her people driven through her ruins
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.82,0:57:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now，alone in Fate's cruel isolation stands Cassandra
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.28,0:57:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her kingdom，family and friends
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.37,0:57:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,driven to the gate
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.75,0:57:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No crime against God or man have I committed
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.72,0:57:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Save to speak the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.76,0:57:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,And each hideous vision born from my mind has come to pass
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.64,0:57:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Troy has fallen
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.98,0:57:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not by my hand，or wish
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.15,0:58:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,But as I foresaw
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.12,0:58:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,So now，Fate's vengeful eye…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.18,0:58:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,is fixed…on me
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.15,0:58:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell us O Cassandra
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.02,0:58:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,where has the sweetness of life gone？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.40,0:58:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,What stays fate's hand from striking now at three？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.40,0:59:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，hold it
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.40,0:59:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold it
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.40,0:59:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone take five
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.58,0:59:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.10,0:59:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid。Your escort has arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.06,0:59:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek，how long have you been here？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.60,0:59:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just got here。Is everything okay what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.19,0:59:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to Mickey？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.53,0:59:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,We swapped。He had to edit
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.78,0:59:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get me instead。What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.74,0:59:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek，don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.03,0:59:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just I need to be alone right now。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.66,1:00:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Being alone is not the answer，Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.54,1:00:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I think it is I need some distance
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.09,1:00:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，do I get a say in this？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.26,1:00:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.19,1:00:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess I'm supposed to be understanding
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.49,1:00:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.74,1:00:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.75,1:00:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alright，let's just assume that the killer is repeating Woodsboro
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.51,1:00:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.84,1:00:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to call you back
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.51,1:00:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,That doesn't explain Sidney's attack
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.18,1:01:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney wasn't killed in Woodsboro
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.68,1:01:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't for a lack of trying
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.81,1:01:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer is trying to finish what was started
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.31,1:01:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid is under protection，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.11,1:01:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.07,1:01:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.57,1:01:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell Bob I'll call him back
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.40,1:01:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,When did she start smoking？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.15,1:01:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ever since those nude pictures on the lnternet
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.82,1:01:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was just my head It was Jennifer Aniston's body
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.41,1:01:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，you're forgetting something
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.08,1:01:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,In Woodsboro，there were more victims before the home stretch
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.41,1:01:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tatum，my cameraman，Himbry
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.37,1:01:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time out。See I don't need to be hearing about no dead cameraman
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.09,1:01:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I'm warning you guys，I'm a verb away from vacating these premises
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.26,1:01:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get me some coffee，donuts，Prozac
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.09,1:01:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,See if I can find some crack special K，Eggs
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.85,1:01:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be back when you guys start talking about something little…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.56,1:01:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,more 「Save By The Bellish」 Alright？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.60,1:01:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,He seems a little shaky
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.56,1:01:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.56,1:01:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the killer is following a pattern
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.11,1:01:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,then maybe we can figure out who is next
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.82,1:01:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,That wouldn't follow the pattern we were all involved in Woodsboro
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.74,1:01:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,It could be anyone of us
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.20,1:01:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay so what do you want to do，Bonehead？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.20,1:02:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just want to sit here and wait for who drops next？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.41,1:02:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，phonehead
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.25,1:02:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale's not here
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.42,1:02:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not interrupting anything，am I You three look deep in thought
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.76,1:02:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you ever feIt a knife cut through human flesh…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.55,1:02:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,and scrape the bone beneath？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.47,1:02:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's him
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.60,1:02:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.43,1:02:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer！He can see us
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.23,1:02:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keep him on the phone
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.11,1:02:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want me to say？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.53,1:02:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Just keep him talking。Come on，Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.07,1:02:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are we doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.82,1:02:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look for somebody with a cell-phone
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.70,1:02:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what's your favorite scary movie？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.29,1:02:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll never find me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.79,1:02:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you care let them have their fun
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.33,1:02:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what's up？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.42,1:02:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your favorite scary movie？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.42,1:03:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show girls。Absolutely frightening
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.43,1:03:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's yours？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.64,1:03:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.22,1:03:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your problem？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.22,1:03:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，let me guess The House on Sorority Row？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.06,1:03:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dorm that dripped Blood？Splatter University？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.81,1:03:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Graduation Day？Final Exam？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.44,1:03:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I close？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.44,1:03:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Closer than you think
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.15,1:03:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Too slow you Geek Do you want to die？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.57,1:03:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that the best you can do？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.12,1:03:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because Billy and Stu were much more original
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.70,1:03:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's this？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.12,1:03:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale Weathers author of the Woodsboro Murders
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.75,1:03:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.84,1:03:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，he's got to be around here someplace
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.63,1:03:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's just playing with us
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.14,1:03:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,White male suspect nine o'clock
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.30,1:03:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,My clock or your clock
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.85,1:03:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your clock。Go around the back
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.77,1:03:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you even here Randy？You'll never be the leading man
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.36,1:04:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.40,1:04:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you try you'll never be the hero
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.16,1:04:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you'll never ever get the girl
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.41,1:04:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Sorry…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.16,1:04:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wrong guy，dead boy
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.17,1:04:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh yeah？Let's redirect mister
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.54,1:04:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I'm so original」
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.18,1:04:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.52,1:04:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Beg your pardon
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.85,1:04:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's your innovation？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.35,1:04:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why copy-cat two High School looser-ass dick heads
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.40,1:04:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stu was a pussy-ass wet rag
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.11,1:04:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Billy Loomis！Billy Loomis！What the fuck？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.45,1:04:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus！What a rat-looking homo repressed mama's boy
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.28,1:04:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why not set your goaIs higher You want to be one of the big boys？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.12,1:04:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Manson？Bundy？OJ？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.33,1:05:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Randy？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.58,1:05:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't see him
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.21,1:05:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Randy
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.09,1:05:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.64,1:05:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who broke my window？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.71,1:06:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did your computer just freeze？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.63,1:06:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have an instant message that's all。Just hit Alt-M
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.35,1:06:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but I'm not signed on
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.31,1:06:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone here in the library all the terminaIs are connected
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.37,1:06:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's here
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.46,1:07:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get her away from the computer Sid，it's probably just a sick joke
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.42,1:07:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait right here，okay
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.27,1:07:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.60,1:07:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.31,1:07:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can we talk for a second？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.23,1:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,This isn't a good time
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.73,1:07:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on Sid，you sent me to prison
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.61,1:07:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's been over a year for you you can give me two minutes
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.78,1:07:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton，I'm sorry。Everyday I'm sorry。I don't know how to apologize
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.82,1:07:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be sorry，sorry-shmory。I have a solution to all our problems
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.08,1:07:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.04,1:07:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,First of all，forget Gale Weathers
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.37,1:07:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,She doesn't get it。She doesn't see the story between you and me
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.46,1:07:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,She wouldn't see the story if it smacked her in the side of the head
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.55,1:07:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which brings me to my point Who calIs me out of the blue？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.22,1:07:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Diane Sawyer。Believe me Sid I was as shocked as you are
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.05,1:08:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you and I go on the air together She will give us the entire hour
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.39,1:08:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are talking Prime Time，Sid You，me and Diane Sawyer
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.27,1:08:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton，I can't
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.40,1:08:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this is about money It's not like we're not getting paid
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.23,1:08:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,$10000 dollars each
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.53,1:08:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to mentioned what I got going on the side with the #900 number.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.07,1:08:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。You don't like the press
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.57,1:08:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know that and I respect it But Sidney
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.50,1:08:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Diane Sawyer。Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.25,1:08:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's a class act。This could be some very，very heavy exposure
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.51,1:08:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.26,1:08:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，between the movie，& the book People know the truth
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.60,1:08:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get on our lives There's been enough exposure
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.68,1:08:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would you want anymore？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.77,1:08:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？I don't know，Sidney
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.77,1:08:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe because I fucking deserve a little exposure
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.61,1:08:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on Sidney，you drag my name through the mud
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.82,1:08:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody thinks I'm some kind of Psycho killer
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.15,1:08:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,& all I'm asking for is one little fucking Diane Sawyer interview
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.41,1:09:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,To maybe give my side of the story straight
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.58,1:09:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm being unreasonable in that request。Do you honestly？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.50,1:09:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Cotton，but no
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.04,1:09:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.22,1:09:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet you're real sorry，Sidney
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.09,1:09:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your angle，Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.80,1:09:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lovable and fucked up Sidney Prescott
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.47,1:09:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody's favorite little victim
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.27,1:09:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.65,1:09:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus！I'm not Billy Loomis
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.48,1:09:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,she killed him，he's dead，remember？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.53,1:09:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run it by me one more time Will you？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.78,1:09:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why did you attack Sidney Prescott
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.74,1:09:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was not attack We were talking，very heatedly
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.70,1:09:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Prescott and I have a very complicated past
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.75,1:09:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't think that was a crime
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.46,1:09:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but homicide is
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.79,1:09:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then book me。Book me
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.26,1:10:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？Look I don't know about homicide
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.43,1:10:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you defiantly got me for raising my voice in a public library
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.81,1:10:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're dealing with four murders here。You watch your mouth
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.85,1:10:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It shouldn't have been Randy It should have been me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.49,1:10:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should call his mother
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.15,1:10:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，I already made that phone call
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.83,1:10:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.04,1:10:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop treating me like glass，Dewey I'm not going to break
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.46,1:10:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay to break
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.38,1:10:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not going to happen
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.55,1:10:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better hope your alibi is air-tight
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.84,1:10:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could I please remind everyone here that I'm an innocent man
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.55,1:10:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you watch TV 「Current Edition」
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.85,1:10:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was a very insightful program On which it was made abundantly…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.77,1:10:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,clear that I'm an innocent man
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.73,1:10:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,So until you find me standing over a dead body with a knife in my hand
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.52,1:10:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you better treat me with the rights and privileges
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.07,1:11:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,accorded to every citizen in this country
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.66,1:11:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there some problem with the word innocent
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.08,1:11:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know It's a big one，Chief？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.34,1:11:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.59,1:11:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're going to let him go
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.43,1:11:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.68,1:11:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't have anything on him
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.64,1:11:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sign here
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.77,1:11:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.36,1:11:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,enjoying the show？Cops are funny
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.07,1:11:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.24,1:11:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Waiting for my 15 minutes of fame You can understand that，can't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.79,1:11:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't do anything stupid，Cotton
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.46,1:11:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were so instrumental in my freedom
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.25,1:12:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not having character doubts now，are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.80,1:12:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，if you change your mind…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.80,1:12:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，take a hike
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.14,1:12:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry about that。What a creep
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.27,1:12:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're going to take you somewhere safe，Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.77,1:12:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，where's that？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.03,1:12:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know But I'll be there with you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.41,1:12:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should get going
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.28,1:12:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take you by the dorm and you can pack some things
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.79,1:12:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've issued a campus lock-in this evening
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.54,1:12:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one is allowed out after dark。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.67,1:12:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's doing this，Dewey？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.38,1:12:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,If not Cotton，then who？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.67,1:12:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，Sid but I'll find him
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.35,1:12:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any leads，Gale？Do you think the killer will come after you？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.35,1:13:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be on the other side of the news？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.40,1:13:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton！Are you still a suspect？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.73,1:13:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all been a huge misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.23,1:13:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton have you been officially released？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.40,1:13:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale，hold on a second How about a photo？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.57,1:13:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,No？You look great
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.53,1:13:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you holding up，Gale？It must be scary…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.58,1:13:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,knowing somebody's out there waiting，watching，enjoying all this
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.04,1:13:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,How does that make you feel？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.04,1:13:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，local woman！I know you hold me up as your career template
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.08,1:13:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it give you some sort of charge to challenge me
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.17,1:13:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,But give it a rest
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.84,1:13:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right。I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.38,1:13:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was，the wrong time。I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.60,1:13:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.73,1:13:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see，for starters they impounded my van
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.44,1:13:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's now an official crime scene Thanks to you
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.11,1:13:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here is your footage
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.65,1:13:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enjoy。See ya wouldn't want to be ya
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.49,1:13:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joel，I need you
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.57,1:13:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you need to have your head examined
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.30,1:14:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I feel bad，Dewey
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.13,1:14:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I feel really bad
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.60,1:14:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never say that because I never feel bad about anything
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.77,1:14:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I feel bad now
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.11,1:14:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this just another brilliant Gale Weathers Performance？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.32,1:14:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no cameras here I just want to find this fucker
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.58,1:14:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really do
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.63,1:14:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.35,1:14:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I give you a hand？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.14,1:15:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's in here？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.40,1:15:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just some crowd footage that Joel shot
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.82,1:15:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.24,1:15:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the killer really is watching and relishing every minute
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.00,1:15:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then he would be here on these tapes，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.67,1:15:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,At each crime scene
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.25,1:15:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's worth a look
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.05,1:15:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Definitely worth a look
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.19,1:15:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.36,1:15:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dubbing room
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.28,1:16:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,editorial。Video archive
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.29,1:16:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's locked
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.33,1:16:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you pick it？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.71,1:16:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would be breaking and entering
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.46,1:16:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,No shit
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.38,1:16:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's got to be a VCR around here somewhere
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.21,1:16:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's in there？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.01,1:16:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we're getting somewhere
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.34,1:16:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.52,1:16:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's start with this one
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.57,1:16:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.41,1:16:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.70,1:16:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did I hurt you？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.37,1:16:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.27,1:17:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a money hungry，fame seeking
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.31,1:17:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,and forgive me for saying mediocre writer
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.98,1:17:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,who's got a cold storage shed where her heart should be
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.61,1:17:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,No offense intended
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.62,1:17:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're cute when you're angry
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.20,1:17:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was being rude
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.38,1:17:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.09,1:17:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never meant to hurt you
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.30,1:17:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.16,1:18:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should be studying you know I got a bio…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.37,1:18:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.71,1:18:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.00,1:18:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.17,1:18:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not my footage
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.01,1:18:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.14,1:18:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you try you'll never be the hero
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.35,1:18:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you'll never ever get the girl
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.52,1:18:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wrong guy，dead boy
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.23,1:18:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay here
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.36,1:18:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey，don't！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.34,1:19:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.18,1:19:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no one there
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.34,1:21:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.69,1:21:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！Gale？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.51,1:21:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.51,1:22:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.77,1:23:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.40,1:23:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.65,1:23:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait up
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.82,1:23:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's fine
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.49,1:23:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm her therapist
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.62,1:23:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye，Derek
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.16,1:23:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We better get going
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.67,1:23:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,When this is all over
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.72,1:24:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll still be here
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.71,1:24:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You！Prepare to Die
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.46,1:24:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gave up your letters
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.81,1:24:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,So romantic
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.40,1:24:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Totally so Greek
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.33,1:25:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's cold
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.22,1:25:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you love，baby！Sidney
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.80,1:25:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you say my Omega Kappa Beta brothers？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.76,1:25:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I said Sidney
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.25,1:25:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,So where you taking us anyway？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.21,1:25:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we told you we'd have to kill you
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.58,1:26:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ask，don't tell
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.33,1:26:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of the car，you fucker
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.13,1:26:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down back there
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.47,1:26:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull it over，you son of a bitch I'll blow your fucking head off
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.39,1:27:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is he dead？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.72,1:27:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think so
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.60,1:27:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，he's still breathing
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.23,1:27:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is he dead？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.48,1:27:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh God，I think so
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.70,1:27:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you suppose to get out of here？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.20,1:27:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are not，it is a cop car
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.13,1:28:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me with this We're jammed up against the wall
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.48,1:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh my God
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.15,1:29:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't… Sid…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.58,1:29:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,God，I hate this shit
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.16,1:29:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh my God，don't do that again
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.76,1:29:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Through the window
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.70,1:29:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.03,1:30:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's jammed，you're going to have to go through the front
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.54,1:30:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,No fucking way
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.74,1:30:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hallie。Do it…Hallie，do it
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.51,1:30:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，that's good
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.25,1:30:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's go
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.09,1:30:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hallie
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.63,1:30:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.26,1:31:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to know who it is
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.30,1:31:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Sid，come on，please
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.47,1:31:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going back
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.47,1:31:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，look，stupid people go back Smart people run
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.10,1:31:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,we are smart people。So we should get the fuck out of here
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.48,1:31:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hallie，I'm sick of running
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.44,1:31:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we know who it is it's all over
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.02,1:31:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can just get the police
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.15,1:31:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，and when we come back he'll be gone
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.48,1:31:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It will only take a minute I have to
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.53,1:31:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，no Sid，come back
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.11,1:31:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，come back
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.42,1:31:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.30,1:31:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.13,1:31:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gone
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.67,1:31:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.33,1:32:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.17,1:32:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get away from me
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.67,1:32:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no This isn't want it looks like
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.30,1:32:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found Dewey。I tried to help him
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.30,1:32:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale！Wait！Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.43,1:32:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.65,1:32:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.11,1:32:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the phone
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.61,1:32:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was in the middle of a story
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.19,1:32:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have your God damned story
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.69,1:32:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.70,1:32:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Operator，this is an emergency get me the police
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.32,1:32:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's happening？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.03,1:32:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer is Cotton fucking Weary
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.41,1:32:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton Weary？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.58,1:33:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.72,1:33:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.65,1:34:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.28,1:34:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.42,1:35:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,God。Derek
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.26,1:35:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.72,1:35:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，thank God，Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.18,1:35:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,T thought I was going to be up there until opening night
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.10,1:35:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit。Who tied these？We have to get out of here
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.14,1:35:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brothers got me，Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.23,1:35:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek，he's after me He killed Hallie
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.81,1:35:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.65,1:35:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,The killer。He's here
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.48,1:35:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.11,1:35:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right here
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.65,1:35:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're fast，Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.16,1:35:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get me down
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.12,1:35:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that if I were you
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.49,1:35:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really want to trust your boyfriend？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.58,1:35:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you know history repeats itself。Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.26,1:35:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mickey
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.68,1:35:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Surprise，Sidney
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.14,1:36:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.43,1:36:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since Derek here disappeared on my ass
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.06,1:36:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been on my own all the fucking night
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.52,1:36:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot，partner
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.07,1:36:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mother fucker！Sid，he's crazy
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.49,1:36:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know me better than that
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.07,1:36:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，I've got to have a partner
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.45,1:36:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly done this alone
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.58,1:36:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Derek
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.41,1:36:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Sid。No…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.37,1:36:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay，Derek。We got her
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.42,1:36:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，he's lying
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.63,1:36:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid！I'm telling you，Sid。Untie me
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.68,1:36:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boyfriend，killer？Boyfriend，killer？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.55,1:36:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid，the man is lying！Untie me Sid，untie me
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.19,1:36:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think，Derek？Sidney experiencing some dejavu？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.77,1:36:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am going to fucking kill you Fucking kill you
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.03,1:36:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are dead！Dead！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.42,1:37:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.04,1:37:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never would have hurt you
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.34,1:37:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.69,1:37:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should really deal with your trust issues，Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.48,1:37:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，poor Derek
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.98,1:37:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's completely innocent and such a nice guy too
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.24,1:37:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's bright，funny and handsome
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.24,1:37:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Decent singing voice and he was going to be a doctor
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.70,1:37:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,This was the kind of boy you'd like to take home to Mom
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.16,1:37:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you have a Mom
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.75,1:37:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.37,1:37:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！So vulgar
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.42,1:37:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy let you talk to him this way？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.67,1:37:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy was a sick fuck Just like you
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.00,1:37:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Billy was a sick fuck who tried to get away with it
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.21,1:38:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mickey is a sick fuck who wants to get caught
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.67,1:38:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah！I've got my whole defense Planned out
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.60,1:38:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to blame the movies
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.51,1:38:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pretty cool，huh？It hasn't been done before
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.98,1:38:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see this is just the beginning A prelude to the trial
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.69,1:38:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's where the real fun is.'Cause these days it's all about the trial
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.19,1:38:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you see it？Effects of cinema violence on society
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.61,1:38:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get Dershovitz Cochran to represent me
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.07,1:38:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bob Dole on the witness stand in my defense
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.57,1:38:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell，the Christian Coalition will pay my legal fees
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.16,1:38:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's airtight，Sid
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.20,1:38:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm an innocent victim
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.21,1:38:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a psychotic
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.38,1:38:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah that will be our little secret
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.71,1:38:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,People love a good trial
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.38,1:38:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like theater they're dying for it
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.38,1:38:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I've worked hard to give the audience what they want
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.51,1:38:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what Billy was good at He knew，it's all about execution
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.06,1:38:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？you are forgetting our thing about Billy Loomis
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.40,1:38:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.27,1:39:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I fucking killed him
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.26,1:39:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sid。You got a Linda Hamilton thing going
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.10,1:39:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，it's nice。I like it
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.52,1:39:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now who's doing that！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.61,1:39:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could that be the mystery guest waiting in the wings？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.45,1:39:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Told you I had a partner，Sid Surprise cameo just for you
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.12,1:39:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.22,1:40:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mrs Loomis？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.51,1:40:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.01,1:40:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy's mother
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.52,1:40:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice twist，huh？Didn't see it coming，did you？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.61,1:40:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It can't be I've seen pictures of you
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.65,1:40:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lose sixty pounds and a lot of work later
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.15,1:40:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's called a make-over You should try it
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.66,1:40:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You look a little tired there yourself，Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.83,1:40:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you two were in this together？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.83,1:40:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，had to have financing Tuition's expensive
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.17,1:40:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deb' there，my backer
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.30,1:40:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We met on the lnternet Psycho-website
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.26,1:40:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,classifieds
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.51,1:40:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only an estimated 97 active serial killers in the country today
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.43,1:40:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So Mickey here was quite a find Definitely one on the way up
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.22,1:40:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,All he needed was a little guidance and nurturing
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.52,1:40:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,As only a mother can do
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.06,1:41:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Told you this was going to work
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.64,1:41:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait till the trial It's gonna rock
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.02,1:41:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mickey there's not going to be a trial
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.58,1:41:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.05,1:41:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two birds。One stone
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.84,1:41:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mickey was a good boy
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.14,1:41:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,but my God that old blame the movies motive
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.72,1:41:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you buy that for a second？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.23,1:41:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poor boy was completely out of his mind
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.06,1:41:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you're not？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.23,1:41:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I'm very sane
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.73,1:41:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,My motive isn't as nineties as Mickey
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.07,1:41:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mine is just good old fashioned revenge
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.41,1:41:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You killed my son
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.28,1:42:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now I kill you。And I can't think of anything more rational
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.33,1:42:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're never going to get away with this
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.12,1:42:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I will
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.38,1:42:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything is traceable back to Mickey
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.63,1:42:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,lncluding the cop-gun he used to kill everybody
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.59,1:42:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,But let's just suppose you had gotten hold of the other cop's gun
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.59,1:42:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You chased Mickey and there was a big shoot out。Big scuffle
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.35,1:42:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you shot Mickey Killed Mickey dead
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.64,1:42:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,But not before he got off one shot at you
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.82,1:42:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Have I covered everything？Are there any questions？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.24,1:42:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any comments？You know what though
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.11,1:42:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who gives a flying fuck anyway
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.78,1:42:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let them try and track down the second possible killer
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.74,1:42:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Debbie SaIt doesn't exist
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.04,1:42:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're as crazy as your son was
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.04,1:42:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you just say？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.17,1:42:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was that a negative disparaging remark about my son？About my Billy！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.34,1:42:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Billy was a good boy
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.47,1:43:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Billy was perfect you did a bang-up job，Mrs。Loomis
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.30,1:43:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not wise to patronize a woman with a gun，Sidney
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.22,1:43:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Randy spoke poorly of Billy and I got a little knife happy
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.27,1:43:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was a good mother
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.77,1:43:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what makes me sick
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.15,1:43:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sick to death of people saying that it's all the parent fault
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.32,1:43:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,That it all starts with the family
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.82,1:43:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Want to blame someone？Why don't you blame your mother？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.49,1:43:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's the one that stole my husband And broke up my family
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.00,1:43:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then you took my son
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.13,1:43:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know what it is to be a mother
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.50,1:43:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,To raise a child To teach him！And guide him
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.51,1:43:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,And abandon him
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.05,1:43:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't Mickey supposed to be dead？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.04,1:46:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you fucking move God damn it
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.47,1:46:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.38,1:46:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay。Everybody slow down
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.22,1:46:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have had a very very bad day
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.35,1:46:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,& I would like to know exactly what the fuck is going on here！Sidney？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.73,1:46:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton，meet Billy Loomis' mother she's the killer
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.61,1:46:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.20,1:46:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who's that？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.41,1:46:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other killer，Mickey
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.03,1:46:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.25,1:46:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Cotton
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.04,1:46:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.16,1:46:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,So…Hi
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.13,1:47:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not Debbie Salt，are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.71,1:47:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not with the Post Telegraph？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.30,1:47:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but I can still help you Cotton
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.47,1:47:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't need her Let me killer her
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.72,1:47:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as she's alive，you're never going to be the lead story
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.27,1:47:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what you really want Isn't it，Cotton？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.73,1:47:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you really want the spotlight Just let me killer her。Right now
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.03,1:47:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you're the only survivor You're the star
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.32,1:47:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,She sent you to prison for a year
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.08,1:47:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Personally I think it's rather poetic
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.51,1:47:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Cotton，don't you listen to her
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.14,1:47:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's quite a predicament here isn't it，Sid？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.35,1:47:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.39,1:47:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean she makes a good point
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.06,1:48:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me think about this。Maybe you should too。I will bet you that…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.73,1:48:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Diane Sawyer interview is looking real good right about now
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.54,1:48:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Consider it done
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.77,1:48:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was intense
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.00,1:49:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Sidney…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.12,1:49:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to know that I would never ever do anything to hurt you
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.50,1:49:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cotton，give me the gun
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.97,1:49:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Okay。Sure。Take it
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.68,1:49:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，we should probably talk about what exactly happened here
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.39,1:49:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get our stories straight？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.36,1:49:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can somebody get me out of here
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.40,1:49:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale。Are you alright？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.74,1:49:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been shot，of course not
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.53,1:49:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me your hand，Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.57,1:49:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Gale，you scared the crap out of me
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.20,1:49:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,There isn't anybody else down there is there？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.54,1:49:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.71,1:49:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,So much for reporting from the trenches，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.29,1:49:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up，Cotton
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.42,1:49:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,How bad is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.21,1:49:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bounced off my rib
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.21,1:49:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jees，Gale you have more lives than a cat
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.81,1:50:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me one of those？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.73,1:50:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is she dead？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.56,1:50:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。They always come back
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.22,1:50:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just in case
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.77,1:50:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,That about wraps it up，Chief
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.77,1:50:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Frank
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.57,1:50:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take it easy，you've got a couple broken ribs there
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.28,1:51:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale。You alright？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.41,1:51:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joel？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.41,1:51:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm back
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.29,1:51:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was thinking maybe we could get the scoop like in the old days
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.50,1:51:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're Gale Weathers at Windsor College
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.21,1:51:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a live one here
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.64,1:51:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.23,1:51:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe you are alive
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.48,1:51:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.48,1:51:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gale
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.15,1:51:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hang in there
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.54,1:51:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.13,1:51:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you tell us what you saw？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.13,1:51:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you tell us what happened in there？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.17,1:52:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sidney，can you tell us how it feeIs to be a hero？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.68,1:52:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talk to Cotton
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.35,1:52:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the man you want to interview He's the hero
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.19,1:52:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened in there？Why are you a hero？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.41,1:52:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Details，please
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.82,1:52:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look guys，no one wants to give you this story more than I do
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.53,1:52:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unfortunately，there's time and a place。lndeed a price for everything
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.75,1:52:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,So feel free to call me
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.33,1:52:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Cotton Tell us something
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.25,1:52:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you one thing
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.05,1:52:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll make a hell of a movie Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最讨厌恐怖片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得看书 我要交生物作业
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说过 票是免费的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊卓·布拉克的电影也在上映
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人要花250元看布拉克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非她裸体
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却会想看没大牌的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「失声尖叫」 刺激肾上腺素
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊吓可刺激起人类本能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你这是什么电影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是无聊白人女孩被追杀
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部无聊的白人被追杀的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为珊卓·布拉克是黑人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖片向来排斥黑人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖片向来排斥黑人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几时拿到黑人电影博士学位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.77,0:01:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有看「娱乐周刊」 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.23,0:01:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看「黑人电影圈」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要全黑的电影？黑人卡司
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑眼珠？黑猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念品 片厂送的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,白色的耶 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有够浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她干嘛非得裸体？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她光溜溜的 关剧情什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我倒不知道 我勃起了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己打手枪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.88,0:03:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 真的 哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.85,0:03:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货 挂他电话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一位？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢玩游戏 哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看后面 看到你男朋友没？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要一个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我钱 我要买爆米花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的钱 我要你的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊怎么不说话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不认识你 就不喜欢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 卖光了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.79,0:05:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,中的爆米花 一杯小健怡可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我不回里面去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小鬼 只是电影嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不只是电影 这是真实故事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人几年前 在加州被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我只想吓你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛要吓我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢被吓 我不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 只是电影嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:06:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且恐怖片 是很棒的前戏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看珊卓·布拉克好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.19,0:06:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 都开演了 留下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别这么爱闹就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我要上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…别那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来得正好 她快被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要爆米花吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,换成是我 我会离开那边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:45.04,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊声尖叫2》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.06,0:12:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢哪部恐怖片？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.32,0:12:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.69,0:12:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,科瑞·吉利斯 5550176
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别气馁 科瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以找刑事检察官
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢「失声尖叫」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要换号码了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,会熬过去的 周末才上映呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 罗恩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被冤枉犯罪一定不好受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是谋杀 这么恐怖的罪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相大白后 大家怎么对待你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你的清白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大半人都不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人还是保持距离
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得很奇怪 毕竟我一向是个平凡人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被冤枉 现已宣判无罪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经被判有罪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要完全洗刷清白 不太容易
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔的书 还有电影
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.13,0:13:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗刷了卡顿·威瑞的冤情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家可能会觉得 盖尔够意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了固定的聚会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我去不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？别想翘头 你答应过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便答应而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是免费啤酒 交朋友的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不太喜欢 宗教聚会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.99,0:13:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是姐妹会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要太孤僻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤立自己不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.66,0:14:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说没事却绷着个脸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快看新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,两名温莎学院的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚看「失声尖叫」时遇害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方目前只公布被害人姓名
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今晚稍后将举行记者会
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,两名被害人皆为大四学生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早上有电影理论课
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识被害人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些命案对你造成威胁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想会发生更多命案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.47,0:14:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们有关被害人的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,发表一点意见好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影剧情造成 戏院谋杀事件
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.35,0:15:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对电影本身的直接结果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样子的说法太假道学了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实生活的暴力不能怪娱乐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 你不看新闻吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.02,0:15:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 凶手戴电影的鬼面具
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怪电影怪谁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影不该为我们的行为负责
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但电影是模仿现实的伟大艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶杀案不该模仿 更不是艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者是我的同学 这是现实世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你们什么是现实
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲身经历过 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实生活是不能被模仿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了 兰迪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手显然在仿效 杀人狂角色
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说有人想演出续集？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想那么做？续集都很烂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就字意看 续集就是二等的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯 很多续集成绩超越原片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,举例一部
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,异形续集就比第一集好很多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊你品味真有够差
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 再举一部
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,异形是经典电影
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「离她远点 贱货」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 正确台词是：「别靠近她 贱货」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是电影里的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 随便 你懂我意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.09,0:16:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼终结者2
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.26,0:16:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很爱卡麦隆是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.01,0:16:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一集已是老掉牙的历史
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉·康纳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:36.12,Title,0,0,0,0,,好 好 《恐怖屋续集》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的恐怖片都被续集破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了 有了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,教父2
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 获得金像奖的例外
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 够了 今天到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:17:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次再继续探讨续集
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,创意先生 你如何使续集成功
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让结局大爆冷门
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百个人在戏院里 没人去救
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为是宣传 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是宣传 这点子可精彩极了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪 事情又开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 看电影才会碰到倒霉事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.24,0:17:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抢变残废被谋杀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.20,0:17:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,影城现在是很危险的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要每件事都否定它
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也该这样 这跟我们无关
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴面具的人在戏院 砍了两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们的生活里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能当做没事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我不再重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能假装快乐的生活吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.89,0:17:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 我到处找你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了 你没去上课
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受不了「众所瞩目」的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.19,0:18:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我能做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,教我如何假装快乐的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这满不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去开房间啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们威胁要怎样？别开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.81,0:18:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让电影下片太蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费宣传 这个周末会大卖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会打破卖座记录
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦瑟斯小姐 嗨 我是乔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的摄影师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.95,0:18:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有经验吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍过宾果总决赛 差点得奖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我告诉你怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指示你就拍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要专注 动作要快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是专业摄影师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,安啦 能有多难嘛 你指我拍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 韦瑟斯小姐 打搅一分种
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喔 只要一秒种
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你常碰到这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.35,0:19:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的忠实书迷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚看完你的书 爱不释手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死你的书了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮本地的报纸写东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛比·索特
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去年参加过 你的研讨会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坐在前排一直发问
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你很面熟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我迫不及待想看到电影
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定受到很多指责
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看暴力与电影的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不予置评
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很希望能引述你说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.85,0:19:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 开始引述
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.85,0:20:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的马屁拍得太明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想这些命案有关连吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对命案有什么看法？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是哈利警长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利警长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 伍兹伯勒血案的作者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想凶手会再犯案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没证据显示 这是个连续杀人狂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想读一篇…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你们有任何 预防措施吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为这是独立的案件
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.34,0:20:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会留意很多可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 事情大条了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有嫌犯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你看 盖尔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔的记者会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔的书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她将主演盖尔的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太毒了 她救过我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她脑袋秀逗了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.07,0:20:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算实施宵禁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.07,0:20:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去听她说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是盖尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩们 你们还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛伊斯姐妹 墨菲姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很可怕吧？撑得住吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪 为了你 搞得鸡飞狗跳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是基努·里维斯的连锁反应
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,海莉 你会带你朋友 来聚会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多功课…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.45,0:21:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们会看着你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚强点 入会后 就是一家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你入会后要穿成那样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,DL姐妹会是一群臭…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.47,0:22:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要入会 谢谢你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.77,0:22:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.66,0:22:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.12,0:22:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情一发生我就搭机赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以谈谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.33,0:22:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.21,0:22:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情发生前都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.17,0:22:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我主演的戏 两天后公演
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.81,0:22:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我很高兴还有很多好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我交了个男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.94,0:22:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他念医科 没精神错乱倾向
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是担心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.91,0:23:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有变态狂想跟随
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利·鲁米斯的脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.16,0:23:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你八成已经认识他…或她
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,或他们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们才不会放过你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你的生活中可以得到刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会不清楚？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我能怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟每个人断绝关系躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.11,0:23:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.49,0:23:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去跟哈利警长谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.50,0:23:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会留下来注意你的安危
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.96,0:23:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.21,0:24:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,老朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍兹伯勒的副警长 他来干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.74,0:24:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他担心我 就像我们的大哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,葬礼最能让家人团聚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.16,0:24:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.12,0:24:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利警长说 那女孩被刺七刀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.87,0:24:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.71,0:24:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.09,0:24:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.21,0:24:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望跟你谈几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.47,0:24:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.93,0:24:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是温莎学院 在此 西德妮与卡顿…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.48,0:24:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,自她曾误控他谋杀她母亲后…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.90,0:25:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,首度重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.23,0:25:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想知道你的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你这两年的情形
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说我原谅你 也忘了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.66,0:25:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样我只想好好过日子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.99,0:25:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有任何话要说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.16,0:25:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱货
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.66,0:25:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 请跟我们分享
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.75,0:25:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟你分享的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.38,0:25:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.42,0:25:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍下来没？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.05,0:25:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.22,0:25:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 等等 她去哪？西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.35,0:25:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是正式访问吗？怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.02,0:25:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.31,0:25:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真冷酷
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.89,0:25:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,您需要在检查门口 搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.73,0:25:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来讨人喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.19,0:25:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应我十分钟的全国报导
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.82,0:25:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我访问到你就有 他妈的十分钟报导
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.07,0:25:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别掉头就走 我还…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.99,0:25:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了我该做的部份
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.24,0:25:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.38,0:26:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 你怎会出现在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不放过她
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.92,0:26:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她受的还不够吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.14,0:26:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我的名字是德威
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.76,0:26:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是做我份内的事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.73,0:26:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人受伤都没关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.06,0:26:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁又挨了一拳？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.40,0:26:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢暴力 可是你活该
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.19,0:26:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在书中第32页 你写到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.90,0:26:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「笨手笨脚的杜威副警长」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.33,0:26:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过我的书
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.70,0:26:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常看书 韦瑟斯小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.79,0:26:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别生气 那只是书中人物
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.08,0:26:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,41页 副警长很没经验
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.26,0:26:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得你反应过度吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.05,0:26:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得你是个贪图名利的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.10,0:27:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,二流作家
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.23,0:27:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没血没眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.23,0:27:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别见怪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.65,0:27:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意的…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我没经验
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.61,0:27:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你是故意贬低我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.78,0:27:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得观众对我期望太高？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.17,0:27:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.13,0:27:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了抱歉我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.18,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才抱歉 我看错你了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.98,0:27:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪 我去执行 我的瘪三警察任务
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.23,0:27:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事 头发染得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.67,0:28:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是强迫推销姐妹会的人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.38,0:28:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得这是个肯定人生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.42,0:28:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳定心理的健康环境
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.43,0:28:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.97,0:28:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心理学修得太过火了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.77,0:28:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.77,0:28:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我没事」变成你的口头禅了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没安全感 神经质 情绪化
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.78,0:28:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.45,0:28:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我很认真的说 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.41,0:28:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喝东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.70,0:28:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.59,0:29:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在一起吗？我三周没看了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.39,0:29:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 又分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.77,0:29:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉发现巴利跟关儿上床 又像前两集那样把他甩了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.23,0:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望她心情好起来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.90,0:29:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 有人插播
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.86,0:29:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥比兹宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.23,0:29:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.07,0:29:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.07,0:29:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.91,0:29:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西 你哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.78,0:29:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.08,0:29:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德 你在哪？你醉了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.87,0:29:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.08,0:29:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德好像醉了 我再打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.25,0:29:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喝醉才打给你 别去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.71,0:29:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我再打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.76,0:29:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德 你好像醉了 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.22,0:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是泰德？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.39,0:29:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我以为你是别人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.14,0:29:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我是别人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.44,0:29:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找谁？这边没人在
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.44,0:29:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.27,0:30:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚协办酸雨慈善会
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.90,0:30:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没去？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.15,0:30:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留守以便接送
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝醉的姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.16,0:30:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.70,0:30:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝酒不闹事是我们的座右铭
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.16,0:30:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打来找谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.25,0:30:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我说你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.67,0:30:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我说再见呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.04,0:30:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛要那么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.01,0:30:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛老用问题 来回答问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.76,0:30:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢打破沙锅问到底
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.47,0:30:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没耐心 你要留话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.97,0:30:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚想死吗？西西
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥比兹宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.03,0:30:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是泰德吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.32,0:30:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是个想吓人的变态狂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.78,0:30:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是电影招来一堆疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.16,0:30:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.12,0:30:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.08,0:30:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到声音
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.29,0:30:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.08,0:30:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.09,0:30:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.46,0:31:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.01,0:31:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀杀杀 死死死
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.22,0:31:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.26,0:31:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信你一个人在
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.72,0:31:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得屋子里有人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.35,0:31:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开这边
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.86,0:31:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话收讯不良 你在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.86,0:31:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.91,0:31:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌 打给校警
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.12,0:31:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.29,0:31:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,校警
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.38,0:31:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我是从…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.04,0:31:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听得到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.72,0:31:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,校警
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.39,0:31:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我是从…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.77,0:31:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不到 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.73,0:32:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在骚扰我 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.98,0:32:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.45,0:32:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.45,0:32:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 有人打来找我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.08,0:32:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.74,0:32:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住这儿 记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.75,0:32:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你去聚会了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.33,0:32:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得换衣服 我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.05,0:32:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥比兹宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.26,0:32:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.38,0:32:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里找？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.88,0:32:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.09,0:32:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那无聊男友打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.31,0:32:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点见 别忘了设定警报器
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.69,0:32:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 泰德
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.03,0:32:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别痴心妄想泰德会打来 别忘了设警报器
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.33,0:34:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.24,0:35:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…求求你 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.97,0:35:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家以为姐妹会的人 喜欢口交
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.27,0:35:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们只是提倡 安全性关系
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.10,0:35:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们讲求爱 尊重与责任
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.36,0:35:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,吹萧也没关系 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.19,0:35:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.32,0:35:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡尾酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.86,0:35:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么拖这么久？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.07,0:35:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克是我们的大哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.70,0:35:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要有一家人的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.12,0:35:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真的教我太多了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有效
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.13,0:35:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 想跳舞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.79,0:35:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.34,0:36:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟那个高大宽肩的男生跳
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.84,0:36:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真伤人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.89,0:36:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国大反击 剧情效果都进步
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.35,0:36:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算续集 那是三部曲之一
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.14,0:36:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那些毛茸茸的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.94,0:36:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.19,0:36:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.86,0:36:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻妞们对你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.32,0:36:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得让人痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不会入会了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.20,0:36:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.12,0:36:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.91,0:36:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,宿舍出事了 到处都是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.87,0:36:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.10,0:36:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真扫兴
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.73,0:36:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该带酒才对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.08,0:37:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对不是自杀罗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.08,0:37:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.21,0:37:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 你才刚来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.75,0:37:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好 被害者是单身一人 姐妹会的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.72,0:37:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 我快截稿了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.05,0:37:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 走
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.64,0:37:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.97,0:37:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,又发生了 是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.44,0:37:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很高兴吧！不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.15,0:37:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去呀 独家会被抢走哦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.16,0:37:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 乔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.41,0:37:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟你老实讲
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.87,0:37:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不行 我是来采访的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.91,0:37:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是来看杀人片
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.42,0:37:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别他妈的扯东扯西
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 拿外套 我送你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.06,0:38:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.43,0:38:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.68,0:38:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.40,0:39:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.82,0:39:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 西德妮 记得我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.99,0:39:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.28,0:39:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你 好戏上场了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.12,0:39:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么不露脸？他妈的孬种
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.70,0:39:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.16,0:39:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.84,0:39:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.00,0:39:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.90,0:39:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.36,0:39:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.87,0:39:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.45,0:39:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.29,0:39:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀手跟德瑞克在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.89,0:40:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.81,0:40:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往那边跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.68,0:40:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,到里面来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.86,0:40:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.99,0:40:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刺到我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.99,0:40:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,压住伤口
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.91,0:40:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察赶来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.43,0:40:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的合作
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.80,0:40:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过几分种就来陪你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.06,0:41:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.43,0:41:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我犯罪生涯中 最简单的侦讯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.85,0:41:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去弄杯咖啡 你要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.15,0:41:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要吗？西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.70,0:41:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样？还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.03,0:41:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.29,0:41:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就知道没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.33,0:41:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会孤军奋战的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.67,0:41:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论你需要什么 我们都会陪你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.68,0:41:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,死掉的女孩真可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.93,0:41:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 整件事都很疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.22,0:41:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克可能会被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.02,0:41:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没有 他没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.85,0:41:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他该知道90年代 不能逞英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.19,0:41:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要回到屋里？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.32,0:42:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绕到屋后碰到西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.33,0:42:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说凶手在里面我就去看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.16,0:42:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运没伤到神经
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.46,0:42:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这伤慢慢会恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.46,0:42:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你回到屋里
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.17,0:42:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.09,0:42:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没打斗 他割伤你就跑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.26,0:42:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没杀了你就算你走运
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.14,0:42:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 要杀可容易的很
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.85,0:42:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.35,0:42:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 可惜轻易就让他逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.81,0:42:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你太晚到
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.23,0:42:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了之后才出现
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.78,0:42:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.84,0:43:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三名被害人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.39,0:43:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫琳·艾文斯 菲尔·史帝文斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.97,0:43:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西·库伯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.06,0:43:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西是真名吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.98,0:43:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 是凯西·库伯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.28,0:43:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟凯西·贝克一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.40,0:43:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.95,0:43:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西·贝克是伍兹伯勒的被害人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.32,0:43:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她男朋友史蒂夫·奥斯也是
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.83,0:43:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟菲尔·史帝文斯一样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.83,0:43:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫琳·艾文斯 莫琳·普莱斯柯特
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.38,0:43:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是西德妮的母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.09,0:43:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想有人 在抄袭伍兹伯勒案？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.21,0:43:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.38,0:43:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这案子真的是模仿案
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.26,0:43:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.93,0:43:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么让西德妮安全？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.27,0:43:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派了最优秀的刑警 保护她
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.40,0:43:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两人非得和你 寸步不离吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.06,0:43:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是连体婴
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.28,0:44:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么才能跟你独处
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.32,0:44:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我认为这样最好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.08,0:44:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点对你较好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.37,0:44:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别因为情绪不好就说气话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.34,0:44:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.72,0:44:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你 你已经受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.81,0:44:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再看到那种事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.39,0:44:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我运气没那么背
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.02,0:44:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真的 这很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.40,0:44:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是担心我安危 还是不信任我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.83,0:44:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜对了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.83,0:44:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了我不想看到你受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.13,0:45:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想看你受伤 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.77,0:45:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重 韦瑟斯小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.73,0:45:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.23,0:45:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.99,0:45:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去搜集资料 你要来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.82,0:45:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不帮你写书 我来帮西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.21,0:45:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想帮她
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.38,0:45:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然也为了帮我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.38,0:45:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 笑一个 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.93,0:45:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我抓到凶手也会笑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.93,0:45:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.89,0:46:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮的父亲没嫌疑了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.10,0:46:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出国了 这有点可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.90,0:46:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做你的调查 这和我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.61,0:46:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威呢 他的出现有点怪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.74,0:46:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.66,0:46:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威是好人 他和其他人不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.62,0:46:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.33,0:46:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得事件如果重演
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.08,0:46:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手很可能是伍兹伯勒的人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.76,0:46:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想西德妮会让我访问她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.26,0:46:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她婉拒各大电视和新闻媒体
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.77,0:46:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可以为了你的纪录片
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.43,0:46:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.27,0:46:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想谋杀的事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.69,0:46:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们查过兰迪没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.15,0:46:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.94,0:46:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是无辜受害者
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.15,0:46:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他有点怪 懂我意思吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.15,0:46:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪不会伤害人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.11,0:46:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多杀人魔也都被这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.91,0:46:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.83,0:46:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.95,0:46:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.79,0:47:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,保镖刑警在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.16,0:47:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.21,0:47:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个是凯文·科斯特纳？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.80,0:47:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边的是李察警官
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.26,0:47:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔羯座 离婚 有两个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.30,0:47:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边的是安德鲁警官
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.81,0:47:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,双子座单身 我想是同性恋
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.06,0:47:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克 你要说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.15,0:47:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上醒来我有个感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.74,0:47:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知如何面对
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.20,0:47:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我决定藏在心里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.66,0:47:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.00,0:47:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·克鲁斯 悍卫战士
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.29,0:47:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.30,0:47:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.17,0:47:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我想我爱你」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.05,0:47:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「人生不就如此」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.68,0:48:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我担心 我不曾有这种感受」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.98,0:48:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我想我爱你 我怕什么」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.98,0:48:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我怕不确定无药可救的爱」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.61,0:48:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我想我爱你 人生不就如此」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.41,0:48:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我担心 我不曾有这种感受」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.04,0:48:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「相信我 你不用担心」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.37,0:48:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我只想让你快乐」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.63,0:48:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如果你叫我走 我会走」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.96,0:48:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「但我还是留下来爱你」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.05,0:48:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「直到你找到快乐」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.22,0:48:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我问你 你真的爱我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.76,0:48:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「因为我想我爱你」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.91,0:49:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位同学 展现一点爱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.75,0:49:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.76,0:49:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道情况有点疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.34,0:49:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是兄弟会的大忌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.89,0:49:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 万万不可
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.43,0:49:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能把兄弟会信物送给女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.89,0:49:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得以任何形式或方式
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.93,0:49:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟会修理他 但这是传统
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.77,0:49:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是传统
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.02,0:49:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是好运 它会保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.29,0:49:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈你这个广受争议的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.46,0:49:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我演西德妮·普莱斯柯特
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.71,0:49:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她发现她男友是疯狂杀人狂
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.22,0:50:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在前一年杀了她母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.97,0:50:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为角色下了多少功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.80,0:50:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了书…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.80,0:50:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们竟让托莉·史培林演西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.97,0:50:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,演我的却是无名小卒
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.14,0:50:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少演你的还有些名气
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.27,0:50:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,演我的是简·西摩尔的马车夫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.36,0:50:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一集是奎因医生
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.32,0:50:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,以下是托莉演出的片段
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.33,0:50:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 你吓到我了 你干嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.12,0:50:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我获释了 我是清白的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.83,0:50:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.34,0:50:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不让我碰你？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.67,0:50:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近碰到太多事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.84,0:50:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要勇敢面对它好好活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.43,0:50:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要接受我妈离开我爸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.69,0:50:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈总会离开我们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.69,0:50:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离开镇上 不是埋在地下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.07,0:51:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈死了 再也不会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.28,0:51:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.99,0:51:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱看恐怖片
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.04,0:51:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会等录影带上了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.91,0:51:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谈正事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.66,0:51:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看马上就有人要怕续集
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.83,0:51:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得搜集更多谋杀电影
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.38,0:51:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要了解续集电影规则
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.92,0:51:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 死得更多
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.21,0:51:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 死得更难看
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.34,0:51:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众会期待更精彩的场面
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.22,0:51:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.31,0:51:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让续集卖座就千万别…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.23,0:51:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道怎么找到凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.77,0:51:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看看嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.15,0:51:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克 就像她前任男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.40,0:51:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他学医 用那点小伤搏取同情
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.86,0:51:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小伤完全避开了主要血管
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.07,0:51:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是德瑞克？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.91,0:51:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设凶手是有点小聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会去重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.79,0:51:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要另外再找新点子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.79,0:52:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管男友 太老套了 还有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.05,0:52:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇 那个昆汀·塔伦提诺迷
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.26,0:52:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他是 那我也有嫌疑 再想
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.22,0:52:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 搞不好你正是嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.22,0:52:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是嫌犯 那你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.15,0:52:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有理
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.90,0:52:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 继续
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.07,0:52:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,海莉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.11,0:52:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮的室友？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.24,0:52:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型杀人狂是白种男性
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.28,0:52:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才完美 违反规则
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.12,0:52:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑人小姐是绝佳的杀人狂
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.91,0:52:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得给黑人小姐一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.92,0:52:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她甜美 所以危险
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.80,0:52:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这些人是你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.30,0:52:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为谁是凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.09,0:52:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.14,0:52:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 凶手？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.31,0:52:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.98,0:52:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她心眼够坏
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.14,0:52:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是个机会主意者
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.98,0:53:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到吗？她在筹备下一本书
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.81,0:53:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,记者最会炒新闻了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.69,0:53:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 盖尔绝不会是凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.45,0:53:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太迷恋她了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.20,0:53:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.95,0:53:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我是兰迪哎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.20,0:53:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是单恋西德妮的爱情奴隶耶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.75,0:53:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道什么是执迷不误
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.29,0:53:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.71,0:53:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有爱的伤疤来证明
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.29,0:53:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.00,0:53:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会跛脚？因为你被刺到背
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.96,0:53:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为神经被切断
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.67,0:53:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但盖尔绝不是凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.72,0:53:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 随便你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.80,0:53:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是凶手 就是目标
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.89,0:53:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 拍一些背景画面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.73,0:53:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以谈一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.48,0:53:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.32,0:53:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不懂 以你过去的遭遇
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.32,0:53:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又发生凶案 何必在这逗留
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.86,0:53:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该在接下工作前 看你的书
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.99,0:53:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在看 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.87,0:53:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,才知道前一个摄影师的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.04,0:54:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被开膛剖肚
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.08,0:54:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要做一般人会做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.83,0:54:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是走人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.34,0:54:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没被开膛剖肚 那是我编的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.76,0:54:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是喉咙被割断
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.92,0:54:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他已不在人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.72,0:54:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是工作
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.72,0:54:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有工作都有一些风险
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.14,0:54:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是专业摄影师就敬业点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.31,0:54:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想报新闻 不想变成新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.10,0:54:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑人在这种情况下 都活不久
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.27,0:54:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是全国电视网
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.69,0:54:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是成名的大好良机
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.90,0:54:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想参与 轰动全国的报导？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.08,0:54:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你 没你我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.21,0:54:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 干活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.46,0:54:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 准备去被宰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.93,0:54:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先前谈过了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.09,0:54:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我认为 你很有表演潜力
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.72,0:55:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 只是命案的事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.77,0:55:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那部电影和我的人生都一团乱
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.10,0:55:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这对你很困难
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.36,0:55:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.40,0:55:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须利用艺术来化解忧虑
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.12,0:55:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是斗士所以你在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.20,0:55:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你会主修戏剧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.91,0:55:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.41,0:55:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.91,0:55:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.08,0:55:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.96,0:55:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.01,0:55:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.97,0:55:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.64,0:55:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这样说太像大学戏剧老师
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.18,0:55:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要利用这种痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.15,0:55:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.81,0:55:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡珊德拉是悲剧性 的预言家
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.19,0:55:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她全预料到了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.95,0:56:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争 谋杀 疯狂
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.12,0:56:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道她被诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.33,0:56:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她的宿命 她拥抱它
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.92,0:56:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,宿命难逃 但身为艺术家
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.38,0:56:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能诚实的面对它 对抗它
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.14,0:56:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.68,0:56:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没替角 我一定要说服你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.64,0:56:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.78,0:56:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 大家集合 第三幕
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.15,0:56:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.17,0:56:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 特洛伊城可怕的恶运
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.88,0:57:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾伫立照亮斯巴达的山坡
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.05,0:57:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今笼罩在废墟的烟雾中
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.31,0:57:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,其王室子女从墙上被抛下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.73,0:57:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,子民从废墟中被驱赶而过
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.82,0:57:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡珊德拉孤独站在残忍宿命中
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.28,0:57:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的王国 家人和朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.37,0:57:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,被赶到大门口
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.75,0:57:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我未犯下反神之罪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.72,0:57:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了说出真相
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.76,0:57:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心中的可怕预言皆已降临
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.64,0:57:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,特洛伊沦陷了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.98,0:57:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是藉我的手或愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.15,0:58:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是如我预见的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.12,0:58:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今宿命复仇之眼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.18,0:58:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯上了…我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.15,0:58:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们 卡珊德拉
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.02,0:58:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命的甜美如今何在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.40,0:58:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何让宿命之手不攻击你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.40,0:59:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.40,0:59:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.40,0:59:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.58,0:59:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.10,0:59:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的护花使者来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.06,0:59:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克 你来多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.60,0:59:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚到 还好吧？怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.19,0:59:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.53,0:59:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们调换 他要剪接
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.78,0:59:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.74,0:59:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.03,0:59:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在需要独处 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.66,1:00:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,独处不是办法
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.54,1:00:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是我需要距离
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.09,1:00:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.26,1:00:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.19,1:00:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我该体谅你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.49,1:00:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.74,1:00:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.75,1:00:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果凶手在重演 伍兹伯勒血案
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.51,1:00:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.84,1:00:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再打给你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.51,1:00:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他干嘛要攻击西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.18,1:01:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在伍兹伯勒又没被杀掉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.68,1:01:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是逃过一劫
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.81,1:01:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手想做个了结
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.31,1:01:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮有人保护 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.11,1:01:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.07,1:01:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.57,1:01:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟鲍伯说我会打给他
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.40,1:01:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她几时开始抽烟了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.15,1:01:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从网路上出现 她的裸照开始
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.82,1:01:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的头 詹妮弗·安妮斯顿的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.41,1:01:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定忘了什么重点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.08,1:01:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伍兹伯勒有更多被害人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.41,1:01:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰坦 他是我的摄影师
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.37,1:01:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂停 我不想听摄影师的事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.09,1:01:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你们 我要闪人了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.26,1:01:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去买咖啡 甜甜圈和镇定剂
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.09,1:01:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能找到一些快乐丸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.85,1:01:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你们谈完我再回来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.56,1:01:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.60,1:01:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像很害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.56,1:01:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心他
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.56,1:01:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找出凶手杀人模式
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.11,1:01:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看谁是下一个受害者
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.82,1:01:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有模式 我们都被追杀过
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.74,1:01:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们任何一个 都可能被害
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.20,1:01:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那你想怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.20,1:02:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着看下一个是谁吗？蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.41,1:02:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 电话小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.25,1:02:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔不在
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.42,1:02:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打搅你们吗？你们好像很烦恼
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.76,1:02:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝过刀子割肉
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.55,1:02:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,的滋味吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.47,1:02:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.60,1:02:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.43,1:02:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手 他看得到我们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.23,1:02:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他挂电话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.11,1:02:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟他说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.53,1:02:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 让他继续讲 走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.07,1:02:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.82,1:02:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,找有行动电话的人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.70,1:02:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢哪部恐怖片？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.29,1:02:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们绝对找不到我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.79,1:02:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕什么？让他们去玩
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.33,1:02:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.42,1:02:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢哪部恐怖片？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.42,1:03:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,「美国舞娘」吓死人了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.43,1:03:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.64,1:03:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.22,1:03:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.22,1:03:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 让我猜 惊魂夜
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.06,1:03:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴血校舍 溅血校园
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.81,1:03:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,结业日 期终考
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.44,1:03:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很接近你吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.44,1:03:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你想像中近
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.15,1:03:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜错了 你想死吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.57,1:03:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经是你最厉害 的招数啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.12,1:03:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一集的凶手 都比你有创意
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.70,1:03:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.12,1:03:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍兹伯勒血案的作者盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.75,1:03:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.84,1:03:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他一定在这附近
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.63,1:03:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在耍我们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.14,1:03:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,白种男性嫌犯 九点种方向
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.30,1:03:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的表或你的表？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.85,1:03:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的表 绕到后面
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.77,1:03:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干嘛？你绝不会是男主角
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.36,1:04:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.40,1:04:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再努力也当不了英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.16,1:04:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且永远无法得到西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.41,1:04:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.16,1:04:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉鬼 死人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.17,1:04:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？想重新再杀人一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.54,1:04:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很有创意哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.18,1:04:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.52,1:04:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.85,1:04:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的创意在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.35,1:04:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛模仿两个 高中窝囊废
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.40,1:04:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯图是没种的娘娘腔
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.11,1:04:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而比利·鲁米斯 搞什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.45,1:04:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,獐头鼠目性压抑又黏着妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.28,1:04:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标订高点 想当大人物吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.12,1:04:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛普森 高天民 陈进兴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.33,1:05:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.58,1:05:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.21,1:05:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.09,1:05:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.64,1:05:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把我的车窗打破了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.71,1:06:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电脑不动了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.63,1:06:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有讯息 按ALT一M
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.35,1:06:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我还没上线
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.31,1:06:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有终端机都有连线
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.82,1:06:52.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你今晚会死）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.37,1:06:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这边
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.46,1:07:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「警察救不了你」 把她带开 可能是病态的玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.42,1:07:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边等
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.27,1:07:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.60,1:07:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.31,1:07:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以谈一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.23,1:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是时候
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.73,1:07:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 是你害我坐牢的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.61,1:07:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐一年牢 不能给我两分种
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.78,1:07:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾 我不知该如何道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.82,1:07:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别遗憾 我给你道歉的方式
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.08,1:07:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.04,1:07:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管盖尔 她什么都不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.37,1:07:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不明白你我之间的故事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.46,1:07:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使凶手杀了她 她都不知为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.55,1:07:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,重点是你知道谁找我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.22,1:07:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛安·索耶 够吓人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.05,1:08:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以有 整整一小时的节目
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.39,1:08:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是黄金时段
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.27,1:08:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.40,1:08:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们付我们一人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.23,1:08:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一万块
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.53,1:08:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不用说我热线电话的收入了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.07,1:08:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不喜欢媒体
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.57,1:08:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很尊重你 可是西德妮…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.50,1:08:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是黛安·索耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.25,1:08:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很大牌 曝光率会很高
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.51,1:08:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.26,1:08:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都从电影和书知道真相
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.60,1:08:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,曝光够多了 你还要怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.68,1:08:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能平静地生活吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.77,1:08:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎样？我不知道哎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.77,1:08:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想更出名吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.61,1:08:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 是你先毁掉我的名誉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.82,1:08:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家都以为我是变态凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.15,1:08:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是要求做个访问
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.41,1:09:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我澄清我的罪名
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.58,1:09:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会太不近人情吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.50,1:09:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.04,1:09:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.22,1:09:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说你真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.09,1:09:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.80,1:09:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱倒霉的 西德妮·普莱斯柯特
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.47,1:09:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最受欢迎的受害人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.27,1:09:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.65,1:09:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我不是比利
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.48,1:09:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了她 他死了 记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.53,1:09:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再跟我讲一遍 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.78,1:09:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么攻击西德妮？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.74,1:09:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有攻击 只是谈得很激烈
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.70,1:09:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮和我 有段复杂的过去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.75,1:09:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她有口角不算犯罪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.46,1:09:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 若有谋杀意图就有罪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.79,1:09:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就收押我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.26,1:10:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀的事我不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.43,1:10:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们因为 我在图书馆喧哗而抓我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.81,1:10:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是四起命案 讲话当心点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.85,1:10:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该杀兰迪 应该杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.49,1:10:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该打给他母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.15,1:10:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打过了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.83,1:10:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.04,1:10:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那么脆弱 轻易被击倒
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.46,1:10:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时脆弱一点没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.38,1:10:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让它表现出来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.55,1:10:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好有充分的不在场理由
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.84,1:10:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我提醒各位我是清白的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.55,1:10:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不看2100全民开讲吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.85,1:10:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很犀利的电视节目
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.77,1:10:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这节目明白指出过我的清白
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.73,1:10:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们亲眼目睹 我持刀杀人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.52,1:10:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你更好的对待我的权利和特权
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.07,1:11:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,赋予每个公民在这个国家
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.66,1:11:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你们不了解 什么叫无辜？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.08,1:11:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要的字 警长？是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.34,1:11:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.59,1:11:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得放他走
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.43,1:11:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.68,1:11:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没证据关他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.64,1:11:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边签名
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.77,1:11:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.36,1:11:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,戏好看吗？警察真可笑
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.07,1:11:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.24,1:11:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你访问我十五分种 懂吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.79,1:11:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做傻事 卡顿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.46,1:11:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮了大忙让我自由
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.25,1:12:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是后悔吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.80,1:12:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 如果你改变心意…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.80,1:12:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让开吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.14,1:12:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾遇到这个怪胎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.27,1:12:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带你到安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.77,1:12:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.03,1:12:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但我会陪着你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.41,1:12:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.28,1:12:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会载你到宿舍 收拾东西
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.79,1:12:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方今晚封锁了校园
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.54,1:12:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天黑后不准有人进出
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.67,1:12:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是谁这么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.38,1:12:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了卡顿还有谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.67,1:12:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但我会找到他
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.35,1:12:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有线索吗？凶手会找上你吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.35,1:13:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你变成新闻主角感觉如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.40,1:13:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿 你还是嫌犯吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.73,1:13:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是天大的误会
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.23,1:13:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正式获释了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.40,1:13:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 等等 拍张照吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.57,1:13:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要？你很上相哎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.53,1:13:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.58,1:13:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,被窥伺的感觉 一定很恐怖吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.04,1:13:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做何感想…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.04,1:13:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你把我 当做踏脚石
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.08,1:13:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战我让你想利用我 一步登天
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.17,1:13:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还早的很呢！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.84,1:13:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.38,1:13:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候不对 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.60,1:13:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.73,1:13:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧！他们扣押了我的车
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.44,1:13:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏你 它成了命案现场
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.11,1:13:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的影片
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.65,1:13:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自个儿慢慢看 我要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.49,1:13:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 我需要你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.57,1:13:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你需要检查脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.30,1:14:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得很惨
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.13,1:14:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得惨透了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.60,1:14:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不认为我会这么惨！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.77,1:14:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在觉得很惨
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.11,1:14:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是盖尔分身 的真情演出吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.32,1:14:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没人在拍我 我只是想找凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.58,1:14:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的想
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.63,1:14:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.35,1:14:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.14,1:15:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.40,1:15:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔拍的群众影片
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.82,1:15:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.24,1:15:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,若凶手 真的无时不刻的窥伺
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.00,1:15:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就会在带子上 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.67,1:15:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在每个犯罪现场
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.25,1:15:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得看一看
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.05,1:15:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定值得一看
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.19,1:15:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.36,1:15:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,配音室
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.28,1:16:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪接室 录影档案
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.29,1:16:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁住了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.33,1:16:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能撬开吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.71,1:16:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是私闯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.46,1:16:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.38,1:16:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近一定有录影机
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.21,1:16:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里面是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.01,1:16:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有进展了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.34,1:16:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.52,1:16:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这卷开始
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.57,1:16:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.41,1:16:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.70,1:16:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄痛你没？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.37,1:16:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.27,1:17:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你贪图名利 原谅我直说
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.31,1:17:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是笔法二流的作家
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.98,1:17:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且冷酷无情
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.61,1:17:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别见怪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.62,1:17:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生气的样子很可爱
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.20,1:17:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.38,1:17:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.09,1:17:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想过伤害你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.30,1:17:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.16,1:18:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要学习你知道 我得到了生物…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.37,1:18:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.71,1:18:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.00,1:18:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.17,1:18:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的影片
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.01,1:18:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.14,1:18:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再努力也当不了英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.35,1:18:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且永远无法赢得芳心
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.52,1:18:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,找错人了 死猪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.23,1:18:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走开
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.36,1:18:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.34,1:19:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.18,1:19:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边没人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.34,1:21:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,操
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.69,1:21:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.51,1:21:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.51,1:22:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.77,1:23:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.40,1:23:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.65,1:23:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.82,1:23:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.49,1:23:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是她的心理医师
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.62,1:23:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜 德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.16,1:23:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好走了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.67,1:23:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这一切过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.72,1:24:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.71,1:24:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 准备受死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.46,1:24:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把兄弟会的信物送人了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.81,1:24:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好浪漫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.40,1:24:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对希腊风味
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.33,1:25:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.22,1:25:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你爱谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.80,1:25:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说爱我们兄弟会吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.76,1:25:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我说爱西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.25,1:25:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要带我们到哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.21,1:25:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来 我们就得杀了你们
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.58,1:26:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问 别讲
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.33,1:26:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,下车 你这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.13,1:26:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.47,1:26:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋 我会让你脑袋开花
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.39,1:27:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.72,1:27:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.60,1:27:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.23,1:27:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.48,1:27:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我想是
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.70,1:27:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么离开这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.20,1:27:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 这是警车
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.13,1:28:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我弄
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.48,1:29:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.15,1:29:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 西德妮 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.58,1:29:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.16,1:29:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 别再来一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.76,1:29:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,从窗子
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.70,1:29:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.03,1:30:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡住了 你得从前面出来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.54,1:30:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.74,1:30:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,海莉 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.51,1:30:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.25,1:30:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.09,1:30:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,海莉
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.63,1:30:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.26,1:31:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.30,1:31:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 西德妮 求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.47,1:31:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回去看
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.47,1:31:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,智障才回去 有点脑袋都会逃
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.10,1:31:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有脑袋 快逃命啦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.48,1:31:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逃烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.44,1:31:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不查明凶手会没完没了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.02,1:31:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以找警察啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.15,1:31:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等警察来他早跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.48,1:31:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一下就好
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.53,1:31:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 不要 回来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.11,1:31:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 回来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.42,1:31:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.30,1:31:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.13,1:31:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.67,1:31:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.33,1:32:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.17,1:32:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.67,1:32:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…不是你想的那样
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.30,1:32:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现杜威 我想救他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.30,1:32:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.43,1:32:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.65,1:32:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.11,1:32:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话给我
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.61,1:32:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在做报导
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.19,1:32:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有你要的报导
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.69,1:32:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.70,1:32:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是急事 帮我接警察
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.32,1:32:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.03,1:32:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手是卡顿·威瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.41,1:32:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿·威瑞？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.58,1:33:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.72,1:33:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.65,1:34:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.28,1:34:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.42,1:35:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.26,1:35:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.72,1:35:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.18,1:35:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我会在这 待到公演当晚
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.10,1:35:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁绑的？我们得离开这边
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.14,1:35:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们抓住我
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.23,1:35:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在追我 他杀了海莉
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.81,1:35:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.65,1:35:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手在这边
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.48,1:35:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪边？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.11,1:35:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这边
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.65,1:35:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你动作很快嘛！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.16,1:35:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我弄下来
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.12,1:35:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,换成是我 我不会那么做
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.49,1:35:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当真要信任 男朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.58,1:35:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道历史会重演吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.26,1:35:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.68,1:35:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到吧！西德妮！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.14,1:36:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.43,1:36:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是德瑞克不配合好
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.06,1:36:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,害我整晚都一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.52,1:36:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你哦 伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.07,1:36:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋 他疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.49,1:36:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不会那样的！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.07,1:36:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须有搭档
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.45,1:36:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人是做不来的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.58,1:36:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.41,1:36:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 西德妮 不…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.37,1:36:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们抓到她了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.42,1:36:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.63,1:36:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 我跟你说 帮我松绑
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.68,1:36:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,男朋友？凶手？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.55,1:36:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说谎 把我松绑
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.19,1:36:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样？似曾相识吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.77,1:36:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你 杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.03,1:36:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.42,1:37:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.04,1:37:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会伤害你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.34,1:37:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不会
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.69,1:37:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得搞清楚 谁才值得信任
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.48,1:37:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的德瑞克
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.98,1:37:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很无辜 这么好的人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.24,1:37:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明 风趣又英俊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.24,1:37:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌声还可以的准医生
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.70,1:37:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会想带回家 给妈妈看的男孩
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.16,1:37:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有妈
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.75,1:37:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.37,1:37:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 这么凶！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.42,1:37:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利让你那样讲话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.67,1:37:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利跟你一样变态！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.00,1:37:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 比利想逃避制裁
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.21,1:38:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而米奇想被抓到
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.67,1:38:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的法庭抗辩 都计划好了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.60,1:38:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把罪过 推在电影头上
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.51,1:38:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷吧 以前没人做过
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.98,1:38:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只是审判前的开场白
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.69,1:38:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,审判才是我的重头戏
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.19,1:38:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为电影暴力 对社会的影响
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.61,1:38:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会请大律师代表我
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.07,1:38:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃多尔会在证人席为我辩护
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.57,1:38:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,基督教联盟会付诉讼费用
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.16,1:38:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太完美了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.20,1:38:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是无辜的受害人
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.21,1:38:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.38,1:38:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那是我们的小秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.71,1:38:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,民众喜欢精彩的审判
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.38,1:38:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟戏剧一样 他们爱死了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.38,1:38:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须满足观众
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.51,1:38:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利真厉害 他知道这跟手法有关
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.06,1:38:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你忘了一件比利的事
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.40,1:38:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.27,1:39:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.26,1:39:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你想学银幕女英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.10,1:39:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好 我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.52,1:39:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁搞的鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.61,1:39:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是久候的神秘佳宾吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.45,1:39:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我有拍档 真相揭晓！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.12,1:39:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.22,1:40:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁米斯太太
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.51,1:40:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.01,1:40:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利的母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.52,1:40:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,够曲折吧！敲破头也猜不到吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.61,1:40:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 我看过你的照片
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.65,1:40:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,减肥60磅 花了不少功夫
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.15,1:40:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可以算是次美容，你也可以试一下
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.66,1:40:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来有点疲倦
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.83,1:40:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩一伙的？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.83,1:40:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要资助 学费很贵
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.17,1:40:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛比支持我
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.30,1:40:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在神经病网站认识的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.26,1:40:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,极机密的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.51,1:40:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,据估计国内只有97个杀人狂
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.43,1:40:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到米奇真棒 他前途无量
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.22,1:40:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要一点引导和教育
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.52,1:40:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是母爱的光辉
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.06,1:41:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说会成功吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.64,1:41:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到法庭审判时 会更惊天动地
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.02,1:41:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇 不会有审判的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.58,1:41:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.05,1:41:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一石二鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.84,1:41:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.14,1:41:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老把罪过推给电影
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.72,1:41:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.23,1:41:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可怜的孩子彻底疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.06,1:41:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你没有？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.23,1:41:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我很清醒
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.73,1:41:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的动机没像米奇那么90年代
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.07,1:41:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是老套的复仇记
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.41,1:41:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.28,1:42:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀你是再合理不过的事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.33,1:42:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不过制裁的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.12,1:42:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然会
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.38,1:42:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切线索都追溯到米奇身上
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.63,1:42:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括他用来杀人的警察配枪
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.59,1:42:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设你拿到另一把枪
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.59,1:42:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你追米奇 一场枪战扭打
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.35,1:42:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了米奇 米奇挂了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.64,1:42:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他先前对你开了一枪
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.82,1:42:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都顾到了吗？有问题吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.24,1:42:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还问我意见啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.11,1:42:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正谁在乎
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.78,1:42:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们去追第二个凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.74,1:42:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛比·索特根本不存在
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.04,1:42:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你儿子一样疯
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.04,1:42:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.17,1:42:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是藐视我儿子的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.34,1:42:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 比利是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.47,1:43:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利很完美 你教得很好
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.30,1:43:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,少拍我马屁 我手中有枪
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.22,1:43:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰迪贬低比利 捅他真爽
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.27,1:43:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个好母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.77,1:43:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最恨什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.15,1:43:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨人家说 都是父母的错
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.32,1:43:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都始于家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.82,1:43:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要怪 怎么不怪你妈
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.49,1:43:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走我老公 破坏我的家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.00,1:43:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你又抢走我儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.13,1:43:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道当母亲的滋味
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.50,1:43:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,养育孩子 教他 开导他
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.51,1:43:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗弃他
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.05,1:43:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇不是死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.04,1:46:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动 可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.47,1:46:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.38,1:46:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 大家慢下来
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.22,1:46:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天非常非常倒霉
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.35,1:46:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道怎么回事 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.73,1:46:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是比利的母亲 她是凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.61,1:46:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.20,1:46:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.41,1:46:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个凶手 米奇
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.03,1:46:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.25,1:46:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.04,1:46:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.16,1:46:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.13,1:47:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是黛比·索特对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.71,1:47:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是邮电报的人
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.30,1:47:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但我还是能帮你
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.47,1:47:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要她 让我杀了她
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.72,1:47:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她活着你就当不了主角
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.27,1:47:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你要的 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.73,1:47:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要曝光出名 就让我杀了她
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.03,1:47:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一生还者 你是明星
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.32,1:47:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她害你坐了一年牢
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.08,1:47:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很顺耳吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.51,1:47:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿 别听她的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.14,1:47:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难做决定 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.35,1:47:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.39,1:47:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得很有理
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.06,1:48:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会考虑 也许你也该考虑
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.73,1:48:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说黛安·索耶访问 有希望了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.54,1:48:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.77,1:48:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好险
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.00,1:49:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 西德妮
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.12,1:49:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会做出伤害你的事
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.50,1:49:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿 枪给我
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.97,1:49:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 当然 拿去
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.68,1:49:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许应该谈谈事发经过
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.39,1:49:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们的故事里
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.36,1:49:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来拉我上去
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.40,1:49:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.74,1:49:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我中枪了 当然不好
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.53,1:49:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,手给我
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.57,1:49:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你吓死我了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.20,1:49:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面没人了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.54,1:49:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.71,1:49:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在跌落舞台报导到此为止
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.29,1:49:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.42,1:49:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,严不严重？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.21,1:49:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹从我的肋骨弹开了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.21,1:49:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你的命比猫还长
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.81,1:50:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一把枪
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.73,1:50:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.56,1:50:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 他们常会复活
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.22,1:50:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.77,1:50:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多了 警长
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.77,1:50:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.57,1:50:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻点 断了几根肋骨
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.28,1:51:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.41,1:51:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.41,1:51:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.29,1:51:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们或许能抢个独家
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.50,1:51:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔在温莎大学报导
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.21,1:51:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边有个人还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.64,1:51:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.23,1:51:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信你活着
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.48,1:51:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.48,1:51:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尔
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.15,1:51:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撑着点
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.54,1:51:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你去
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.13,1:51:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你看到什么
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.13,1:51:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.17,1:52:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 请谈谈当英雄的感受
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.68,1:52:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才是英雄 卡顿
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.35,1:52:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才是采访对象 他是英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.19,1:52:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？为何你是英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.41,1:52:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说细节
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.82,1:52:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人比我更想提供这个故事
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.53,1:52:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜要看时间地点和价码
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.75,1:52:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时打给我
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.33,1:52:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡顿 说一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.25,1:52:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有一件事我可以说
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.05,1:52:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这故事会拍成很棒的电影 谢谢
